ermanently deleted. This cannot be undone.'=>'此网络中所有站点的设置、活动和报名都将被永久删除。此操作无法撤销。','All states text'=>'多有州文档','All towns/cities text'=>'所有城镇/城市文档','All translations of this event will be detached from the recurring event.'=>'此活动的所有翻译版本将与定期活动分离。','All your settings and events will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone.'=>'您所有的设置和活动都将被永久删除，该行为无法被撤销。','All your settings, including email templates and template formats for Events Manager will be deleted.'=>'您所有的设置，包括电子邮件模版和活动管理器的样板格式都将被删除。','Allow %s to appear in the built-in search results.'=>'允许 %s 出现在内置搜索结果中。','Allow Maybe?'=>'允许“可能出席”？','Allow Multiple Uploads'=>'允许多文件上传','Allow RSVP Actions'=>'允许回复邀请操作','Allow WordPress post-style archives.'=>'允许WordPress邮报风格存档。','Allow anonymous event submissions?'=>'允许匿名活动发送？','Allow bookings with registered emails?'=>'允许使用已注册的电子邮件报名？','Allow double bookings?'=>'允许重复下单？','Allow format shortcode parameters?'=>'允许格式简码参数？','Allow guest bookings?'=>'允许游客订购？','Allow overbooking when approving?'=>'通过认可允许超额预定？','Allow subsites to create their own'=>'允许子站点创建自己的原型','Allow users to respond with a \'Maybe\' status rather than Attending or Not Attending'=>'允许用户以“可能出席”状态回复，而不仅限于出席或不出席','Allowed Extensions'=>'允许的扩展名','Already Booked'=>'已经预订','Already attending'=>'已经正在参与','Already booked'=>'已经报名','Already have a license? Download the plugin from %s, upload it under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'已有许可证？请从 %s 下载插件，在“插件 > 添加新插件”下上传，然后在其设置中激活您的许可证。','Already migrated: %s'=>'已迁移:%s','Also, the following will occur:'=>'此外，还将发生以下情况：','Always check the latest stable version?'=>'始终检查最新稳定版本？','Always show and ask for consent'=>'始终显示并请求同意','An email will be sent to an administrator of your choice when an event is published by users who are not administrators.'=>'当一项活动被非管理员的用户发布时，一份邮件将会发送至你选择的管理员。','An email will be sent to the event contact if someone cancels their booking.'=>'如果有人取消了他们的报名将有一份邮件发送至活动联系人。','An email will be sent to the event owner when their event is approved. Users requiring event approval do not have the <code>publish_events</code> capability.'=>'当活动审核通过后活动主人将手到一封邮件。申请审核活动的用户没有发布活动<code>publish_events</code> 的能力。','An email will be sent to your administrator emails when an event is submitted and pending approval.'=>'当一项活动被提交并等待审核通过，一份邮件将发送至你的管理员。','An error has occurred, not all sites were upgraded successfully.'=>'发生错误，并非所有站点都已成功升级。','An error occurred.'=>'出现了一个错误。','An event with no bookings.'=>'没有被订购的活动','An event with this name and start is already on this site (event %d).'=>'此站点上已有同名且开始时间相同的活动（活动 %d）。','An import is running. Wait for it to finish, or pause it first.'=>'正在进行导入。请等待其完成，或先将其暂停。','An organizer with this name is already on this site.'=>'此站点上已有同名组织者。','And much more'=>'以及更多功能','Anonymous Submitter Info'=>'匿名发布者信息','Anonymous event submissions'=>'匿名发送的活动','Anonymous submitters cannot see or modify their event once submitted. You can customize the success message they see here.'=>'匿名发送者一旦发送活动之后无法看见或修改他们的活动。您可以自定义他们在这里看到的成功发送的消息。','Another request is already updating this online location.'=>'已有另一个请求正在更新此在线地址。','Any Type'=>'任意类型','Appears as the first default search option.'=>'作为第一个默认搜索选项出现','Appears as the label for this search option.'=>'显示为此搜索选项的标签。','Appears on the text search filter above the categories list.'=>'显示在分类列表上方的文字搜索过滤器中。','Appears on the text search filter above the tags list.'=>'显示在标签列表上方的文字搜索过滤器中。','Appears within the input box.'=>'出现在输入框','Apply global capabilities?'=>'应用全局的能力吗？','Approval Required?'=>'要求审核？','Approve'=>'同意','Approved'=>'审核通过','Archetype'=>'原型','Archetypes UI Builder'=>'原型界面构建器','Are current events past events?'=>'当前活动还是过去活动？','Are you sure you want to cancel your booking?'=>'您确定要取消您的报名吗？','Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'确定要继续吗？','Are you sure you want to convert all repeating events into recurring events?'=>'确定要将所有重复活动转换为定期活动吗？','Are you sure you want to convert this repeating event?'=>'确定要转换此重复活动吗？','Are you sure you want to delete all recurrences of this event?'=>'您确定要删除这项活动中的所有定期活动吗？','Are you sure you want to delete this archetype? This action cannot be undone.'=>'确定要删除此原型吗？此操作无法撤销。','Are you sure you want to delete this file? It will be deleted upon submission.'=>'确定要删除此文件吗？它将在提交时被删除。','Are you sure you want to delete this item? This action cannot be undone.'=>'确定要删除此项吗？此操作无法撤销。','Are you sure you want to delete this ticket?'=>'确定要删除此门票吗？','Are you sure you want to delete this ticket? All bookings related to this ticket will be deleted once you save this %s.'=>'确定要删除此门票吗？保存此%s后，与此门票相关的所有报名都将被删除。','Are you sure you want to delete?'=>'您确定想要删除吗？','Are you sure you want to delete? This action cannot be undone.'=>'确定要删除吗？此操作无法撤销。','Are you sure you want to detach this event? By doing so, this event will be independent of the recurring set of events.'=>'您确定想分离这个活动吗？如果您这样做了，这个活动被从一组定期活动中剥离出来成为独立的活动。','Are you sure you want to disable bookings? If you do this and save, you will lose all previous bookings. If you wish to prevent further bookings, reduce the number of spaces available to the amount of bookings you currently have'=>'您确定要取消报名吗？如果您这样做并保存了，将丢失所有过去的报名信息。如果您并不想进一步订购，您可以将可用空间的数量减少至您目前拥有的报名数量。','Are you sure you want to proceed? We recommend you back up your database first, just in case!'=>'确定要继续吗？为防万一，建议您先备份数据库！','Are you sure you want to reset Events Manager?'=>'您确定想要重新设置活动管理器吗？','Are you sure you want to uninstall Events Manager?'=>'您确定要卸载活动管理器吗？','As a site admin, you see all group events, users will only be able to choose groups they are admins of.'=>'作为一个网站管理员，你可以看到全部的团队活动， 一般使用者只能选择他们管理的的团队。','Ascending'=>'递增','Aside from pages we automatically generate and include certain jQuery files, if you are using Widgets, Shortcode or PHP to display specific items you may need to tell us where you are using them for them to work properly. Below are options for you to include specific jQuery dependencies only on certain pages.'=>'除了我们自动生成的页面会自动包含某些 jQuery 文件外，如果您使用小工具、简码或 PHP 来显示特定内容，可能需要告知我们您在哪些页面使用了它们，以便其正常工作。下面的选项可让您仅在特定页面上包含特定的 jQuery 依赖项。','Attachment ID not found.'=>'未找到附件 ID。','Attendee %d'=>'参会者 %d','Attendee %s'=>'参会者%s','Attendee (Per Space Booked)'=>'参会者（按每个已报名额）','Attendee names, answers to attendee fields and check-in status are copied and kept with each ticket. Without Events Manager Pro they are not shown, so you will see each booking, its tickets and the person who booked.'=>'参会者姓名、参会者字段的回答和签到状态会被复制并保存在每张门票中。没有 Events Manager Pro 时这些内容不会显示,因此您将看到每个报名、其门票以及报名人。','Attendees'=>'参会者','Attending'=>'参加','Attributes'=>'属性','AutoTLS'=>'AutoTLS','Avail. Spaces'=>'可用席位','Availability'=>'有效性','Available'=>'有余量','Available Archetypes'=>'可用原型','Available Spaces'=>'席位','Available for'=>'供','Available from'=>'可以从','Available spaces'=>'席位','Available until'=>'可直到','Average Sale'=>'平均销售额','Average Ticket'=>'平均门票价格','Awaiting Online Payment'=>'等待在线支付','Awaiting Payment'=>'等待支付','Bar Graph'=>'柱状图','Base Event Settings'=>'基础活动设置','Base Location Settings'=>'基础地点设置','Base font size'=>'基础字号','Base font weight'=>'基础字重','Base line height'=>'基础行高','Basic HTML is allowed in ticket labels and descriptions.'=>'标签和描述中允许基本的HTML。','Basic Only'=>'仅基本样式','Be aware that some themes will not work with this option, if so (or you want to make your own changes), you can create a file named <code>single-%s.php</code> <a href=\'#\'>as shown on the WordPress codex</a>, and leave this set to Posts.'=>'注意某些主题不能和这个选项一起使用，如果这样（或者你想自己作改变），你可以创建一个叫做<code>single-%s.php</code> <a href=\'#\'>as shown on the wordpress codex</a>的文件，离开这个组去帖子。','Before'=>'前','Before you save your changes, you can quickly send yourself a test email by clicking this button.'=>'在保存你的修改之前，你可以点击此按钮，快速的寄一封测试邮件给自己。','Below are translations for your location address. If left blank, the language of the original event will be used.'=>'以下是您的地点地址翻译。如果留空，将使用原始活动的语言。','Below are translations for your tickets. If left blank, the language of the original event will be used.'=>'以下是您的门票翻译。如果留空，将使用原始活动的语言。','Below you will find texts that will be displayed to users in various areas during the bookings process, particularly on booking forms.'=>'在下面您将会找发现一个在订购过程中将展示给用户看的文本，尤其是订购表单。','Block Editor (Gutenberg)'=>'区块编辑器（Gutenberg）','Block Editor development is still ongoing, switch back to the Classic Editor if you experience issues.'=>'区块编辑器仍在开发中，如遇问题请切换回经典编辑器。','Block editor layout'=>'区块编辑器布局','Blog Default Timezone'=>'博客默认时区','Body Classes'=>'体类','Book Now'=>'现在就报名','Book Now!'=>'现在就报名！','Booked'=>'已报名','Booked Spaces'=>'已报名席位','Booked User Emails'=>'报名用户电子邮件','Booked/Available'=>'已报名/有余量','Booking'=>'报名','Booking %s'=>'%s 报名','Booking %s.'=>'%s 报名。','Booking Actions'=>'报名操作','Booking Cancellation Warning'=>'报名取消警告','Booking Cancelled'=>'报名取消','Booking Chart'=>'报名图表','Booking Comment'=>'报名注解','Booking Confirmation'=>'报名确认','Booking Confirmed'=>'报名审核通过','Booking Cut-Off Date'=>'报名戒指日期','Booking Data'=>'报名数据','Booking Date'=>'订日期','Booking Details'=>'报名详情','Booking Email Templates'=>'报名邮件模版','Booking Form'=>'订购于','Booking ID'=>'报名ID','Booking ID.'=>'报名 ID。','Booking Intent'=>'报名意向','Booking Management Pages'=>'报名管理页面','Booking Meta'=>'报名元数据','Booking Notes'=>'报名备忘','Booking Pending'=>'报名待审核','Booking RSVP'=>'报名回复邀请','Booking RSVP status set to \'%s\'.'=>'报名回复状态已设置为“%s”。','Booking Rejected'=>'报名被驳回','Booking Related Placeholders'=>'和报名相关的占位符','Booking Status'=>'报名状态','Booking Statuses'=>'报名状态','Booking Submit Button'=>'报名提交按钮','Booking Summary'=>'报名摘要','Booking admin pages'=>'报名管理页面','Booking already made'=>'已报名','Booking button feedback messages'=>'预定按钮反馈信息','Booking cancellation emails are not sent.'=>'不会发送报名取消邮件。','Booking cancellation emails will be sent.'=>'将发送报名取消邮件。','Booking cancellations'=>'报名取消','Booking cancelled'=>'报名取消','Booking cancelled email'=>'报名取消邮件','Booking cancelled email subject'=>'报名取消邮件主题','Booking cannot be made, not enough spaces available!'=>'无法报名，已经超过人数！','Booking complete'=>'预定完成','Booking confirmed email'=>'报名审核通过邮件','Booking confirmed email subject'=>'报名审核通过邮件主题','Booking could not be %s.'=>'报名不能是 %s。','Booking could not be created'=>'报名无法被创建','Booking could not be deleted.'=>'无法删除报名。','Booking could not be saved.'=>'无法保存报名。','Booking data is invalid.'=>'报名数据无效。','Booking error'=>'预定错误','Booking form feedback messages'=>'订购表单和反馈信息','Booking form section headers'=>'报名表单分节标题','Booking form texts/messages'=>'订购表单文本/消息','Booking in progress'=>'预定正在进行','Booking not found.'=>'未找到报名。','Booking note successfully added.'=>'报名标签已成功添加。','Booking pending email'=>'待审核报名邮件','Booking pending email subject'=>'待审核报名邮件主题','Booking reference'=>'报名编号','Booking rejected email'=>'被拒绝邮件','Booking rejected email subject'=>'被拒绝报名邮件主题','Booking status could not be changed.'=>'无法更改报名状态。','Booking status is invalid.'=>'报名状态无效。','Booking successful, pending confirmation (you will also receive an email once confirmed).'=>'成功报名， 等待确认（一旦确认，您将收到一份电子邮件）','Booking successful.'=>'报名成功。','Booking summary default text'=>'报名摘要默认文本','Booking...'=>'报名中...','Bookings'=>'报名','Bookings %s. Mails Sent.'=>'该报名已发送至 %s. 邮箱。','Bookings Consent Error'=>'报名同意错误','Bookings Forms'=>'报名表单','Bookings Stats'=>'报名统计','Bookings Table Settings'=>'订购表格设置','Bookings View'=>'报名视图','Bookings are closed for this event.'=>'此活动的报名已被关闭。','Bookings are disabled in Events Manager. Migrating tickets turns them on.'=>'Events Manager 中已禁用报名。迁移门票会将其启用。','Bookings closed'=>'被关闭的订购','Bookings data'=>'注册数据','Bookings disabled'=>'预订已关闭','Bookings for %s'=>'%s 的报名','Bookings have closed (e.g. event has started).'=>'订购已被关闭','Bookings that are uncancelled are returned to their previous state (if available), the %1$s PHP constant value or if previous options are not available then pending/approved according to your booking approval settings.'=>'恢复取消的报名会回到其之前的状态（如有）、%1$s PHP 常量值，或者在没有之前状态时，根据您的报名审核设置变为待审核/审核通过。','Bookings to individual %s recurrences will be preserved unless you delete tickets or choose to reschedule and delete rescheduled recurrences.'=>'除非您删除门票或选择重新安排并删除已重新安排的重复实例，否则单个%s重复实例的报名将被保留。','Bookings to individual event recurrences will be preserved if event times and ticket settings are not modified.'=>'如果未修改活动时间和门票设置，单个活动重复实例的报名将被保留。','Bookings will be automatically cancelled.'=>'报名将被自动取消。','Bookings will not be confirmed until the event administrator approves it.'=>'直到管理员批准，报名才算审核通过。','Bookings/Registration'=>'报名/注册','Buffer'=>'缓冲时间','Bulk Actions'=>'批量操作','Bulk actions'=>'批量操作','Button & page labels'=>'按钮和页面标签','Buy %s'=>'购买 %s','Buy on Woo.com'=>'在 Woo.com 购买','By default, event spaces become unavailable once there are enough CONFIRMED bookings. To reserve spaces even if unapproved, choose yes.'=>'系统默认的，任何一个席位一旦有了足够的审核通过报名将成为不可用的。要使在审核没有被批准的情况下保留空间，请选择是的。','By default, events that have an end date later than today will be included in searches, set this to yes to consider events that started \'yesterday\' as past.'=>'默认情况下，结束日期晚于今天的活动将包含在搜索中；将此项设置为是，则会把“昨天”开始的活动视为已过期。','By default, if a calendar day only has one event, it display a single event when clicking on the link of that calendar date. If you select Yes here, you will get always see a list of events.'=>'默认的，如果一天里只有一个活动，在点击日期上的链接后将显示一个活动。如果您在这里选择是的，您将总是能看见这个活动列表。','By default, if a guest tries to book an event using the email of a user account on your site they will be asked to log in, selecting yes will bypass this security measure.'=>'默认情况下，如果访客尝试使用你站点上某个用户账户的电子邮件报名活动，系统会要求其登录。选择“是”将绕过此安全措施。','By default, when a booking is made by a user, this booking is tied to a user account, if the user is not registered nor logged in and guest bookings are enabled, an account will be created for them.'=>'默认的，当用户下好报名后，这个报名就和一个用户账户绑在了一起。如果这个用户并没有注册或登录，则启用了游客下报名模式，系统将会为他们创建以个用户账户。','By editing your primary recurrence set, you will change all subsequent default values of your other recurrences.'=>'编辑您的主重复集将更改其他重复实例之后的所有默认值。','By using formats, you can control how your %s are displayed from within the Events Manager <a href=\'#formats\' class=\'nav-tab-link\' rel=\'#em-menu-formats\'>Formatting</a> tab above without having to edit your theme files.'=>'通过使用形式，您可以在上方 Events Manager 的<a href=\'#formats\' class=\'nav-tab-link\' rel=\'#em-menu-formats\'>格式化</a>标签页中控制 %s 的显示方式，而无需编辑主题文件。','CPT'=>'CPT','CPT (Plural)'=>'CPT（复数）','CPT (Single)'=>'CPT（单数）','CPT name (plural) must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'CPT 名称（复数）只能包含小写字母、数字和下划线。','CPT name must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'CPT 名称只能包含小写字母、数字和下划线。','CPTs'=>'CPT','CSS File'=>'CSS 文件','CSV file'=>'CSV 文件','CSV file does not appear to contain valid data.'=>'CSV 文件似乎不包含有效数据。','Calendar'=>'日历','Calendar Day Event List Settings'=>'日历日活动列表设置','Calendar Selection'=>'日历选择','Calendar Size'=>'日历大小','Calendar events/day limit'=>'日历活动/天限制','Calendar settings'=>'日历设置','Calendar size'=>'日历大小','Call get-booking-requirements with this event\'s ID for the exact required fields, their payload locations (attendee fields go under em_tickets[<ticket_id>].ticket_bookings[].attendee), and a ready-to-submit example.'=>'请使用此活动的 ID 调用 get-booking-requirements，以获取确切的必填字段、它们的载荷位置（参会者字段位于 em_tickets[<ticket_id>].ticket_bookings[].attendee 下）以及可直接提交的示例。','Calling em_get_option() too early whilst EM\\Archetypes class is not available.'=>'在 EM\\Archetypes 类不可用时过早调用了 em_get_option()。','Can attendees change their RSVP status? You can choose whether they can uncancel an RSVP below as well.'=>'参会者可以更改其回复邀请状态吗？你还可以在下方选择是否允许他们恢复已取消的回复。','Can be in form of pixels or a percentage such as %s or %s.'=>'可以是像素或百分比，例如 %s 或 %s。','Can users cancel their booking?'=>'用户可以取消他们的报名吗？','Can users uncancel their booking?'=>'用户可以恢复已取消的报名吗？','Cancel'=>'取消','Cancel Ticket Recreation'=>'取消重新创建门票','Cancel all confirmed and pending bookings automatically.'=>'自动取消所有已确认和待审核的报名。','Cancel bookings?'=>'取消报名？','Cancelation complete'=>'取消完成','Cancelation error'=>'取消错误','Cancelation in progress'=>'取消正在进行','Canceling...'=>'取消...','Cancellation'=>'取消','Cancellation Actions'=>'取消操作','Cancellations'=>'取消','Cancellations are not permitted for this booking.'=>'此报名不允许取消。','Cancelled'=>'被取消','Cancelled event email'=>'活动取消电子邮件','Cannot create a Archetype CPT name %s, this must be at most 20 characters long, containing letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'无法创建名为 %s 的原型 CPT，其名称最多 20 个字符，且只能包含字母、数字、短横线和下划线。','Canvas tabs'=>'画布选项卡','Categories'=>'类别','Categories dropdown label'=>'分类下拉菜单标签','Categories list page'=>'类别列表页面','Category'=>'类别','Category IDs'=>'ID类别','Category Related Placeholders'=>'和类别相关的占位符','Category pages'=>'类别页面','Category:'=>'类别：','Change'=>'改变','Changed timeslots get %s'=>'已更改的时段将%s','Changes a booking status, such as approving, rejecting, or cancelling it.'=>'更改报名状态，例如批准、拒绝或取消。','Changes saved'=>'更改保存','Changes saved.'=>'保存更改','Changing the location of this event will delete its %s meeting or broadcast, and anyone holding the old link will no longer be able to join.'=>'更改此活动的地址将删除其 %s 会议或直播，持有旧链接的任何人都将无法再加入。','Chart Options'=>'图表选项','Chart Type'=>'图表类型','Check Dev Versions'=>'查看Dev版本','Check attendees in at the door by scanning tickets, manage events and bookings, and follow booking and sales status from your phone. Available on the App Store for iPhone and iPad. Included with Pro Plus, or available by subscription for any Events Manager site.'=>'通过扫描门票在门口为参会者签到，管理活动和报名，并在手机上跟踪报名和销售状态。可在 App Store 下载，支持 iPhone 和 iPad。Pro Plus 已包含，也可为任何 Events Manager 站点订阅使用。','Check this option if you want the event contact to receive an email when someone books places. An email will be sent when a booking is first made (regardless if confirmed or pending)'=>'如果您想让活动联系人收到电子邮件当有人预定位置的时候查看此选项。当预定第一次完成时就将由一份电子邮件被发送（无论这份报名是否审核通过）','Check this option if you want to prevent the WordPress registration email from going out when a user anonymously books an event.'=>'如果当用户匿名订购一个活动时您想要阻止WordPress注册邮件泄露信息请查看此选项。','Check this option to enable Google Map integration.'=>'勾选此选项以启用 Google 地图集成。','Checking for dev versions.'=>'检查dev版本。','Checking for the latest stable version.'=>'正在检查最新稳定版。','Checking...'=>'搜索中…','Checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release, skipping the staggered rollout delay (which can take up to 24 hours). Any newer stable version will appear on your Plugins or Updates page for a manual update.'=>'直接向 WordPress.org 检查最新稳定版本，跳过可能长达 24 小时的分批推送延迟。任何较新的稳定版本都会显示在您的插件或更新页面，供手动更新。','Choose a color for your %s. You can access this using the %s placeholder.'=>'为您的%s选择一个颜色。您可以使用%s占位符访问这个。','Choose a settings file saved from a backup or another Events Manager installation and click the \'%s\' button.'=>'选择从备份或其他 Events Manager 安装中保存的设置文件，然后点击“%s”按钮。','Choose an image for your %s, which can be displayed using the %s placeholder.'=>'为您的%s选择一个图像，使用%s个占位符能使该图像显示。','Choose another file'=>'选择其他文件','Choose from most used %s'=>'从最常用的%s中选择','Choose from most used event categories'=>'在被最多使用的活动类别中选择','Choose from most used event tags'=>'在最多使用的活动标签中选择','Choose graph type and stacking view options. Some views and stacking may not be available for all setting combinations.'=>'选择图表类型和堆叠视图选项。部分视图和堆叠方式可能不适用于所有设置组合。','Choose how prices are displayed. <code>@</code> will be replaced by the currency symbol, and <code>#</code> will be replaced by the number.'=>'选择价格的显示方式。<code>@</code>将被货币标志代替，<code>#</code> 将被数字代替。','Choose how timeslots are listed in booking forms for recurring events and events with multiple timeslots.'=>'选择在定期活动和具有多个时间段的活动的报名表单中如何列出时间段。','Choose how to format your group heading dates. Leave blank for default.'=>'选择分组标题日期的格式。留空则使用默认值。','Choose how to format your group headings.'=>'选择分组标题的格式。','Choose how to show a information about an event when clicking or hovering over a single event on the calendar.'=>'选择在日历上点击或悬停于单个活动时如何显示活动信息。','Choose the start date for comparing equivalent date ranges. The latest comparison end date is day before main duration start date.'=>'选择对比日期范围的开始日期。最晚的对比结束日期为主时段开始日期的前一天。','Choose to show events within a specific time range.'=>'选择显示特定时间范围内的活动。','Choose what to show users on their booking management page.'=>'选择在用户的报名管理页面向其显示的内容。','Choose whether or not to display a login form in the booking form area to remind your members to log in before booking.'=>'选择是否在订购表单区域中显示登录表单，来提醒用户在订购前登录。','Choose whether to display the main search bar. If disabled, advanced search fields will be shown in \'Inline\' mode automatically. You must also choose to enable at least one advanced search field, to avoid having an emtpy search form.'=>'选择是否显示主搜索栏。如果停用，高级搜索字段将自动以“内联”模式显示。你还必须至少启用一个高级搜索字段，以避免搜索表单为空。','Choose whether to show a preview of the upcoming events for the date clicked on, or directly link to the calendar day.'=>'选择是显示所点击日期的即将举行的活动预览，还是直接链接到该日历日期。','Choose which %s account hosts this event.'=>'选择由哪个 %s 账户主办此活动。','Choose which order your tickets appear.'=>'请选择门票的显示次序。','Choose your currency for displaying event pricing.'=>'选择你想用来显示活动价格的货币种类。','Choose/Upload Image'=>'选择/上传图像','City'=>'城市','City/Town'=>'城市/城镇','City/Town:'=>'城市/城镇:','Classic Editor'=>'经典编辑器','Clear All'=>'全部清除','Click the button below to mass-convert all your repeating events into recurring events.'=>'点击下方按钮，将所有重复活动批量转换为定期活动。','Click to toggle'=>'点击切换','Clicking these buttons will not have any effect until you save your settings!'=>'在保存设置之前，点击这些按钮不会产生任何效果！','Close Ticket Editor'=>'关闭门票编辑器','Collapse All'=>'折叠所有','Color'=>'颜色','Column %d'=>'第 %d 列','Column in the file'=>'文件中的列','Columns for repeating events'=>'重复活动的列','Columns to choose'=>'可选择的栏目','Columns to export'=>'要导出的栏目','Columns to show'=>'要显示的栏目','Comma-separated address(es) notified of each withdrawal for manual review. Leave blank to use the site admin email.'=>'接收每次撤回通知以便人工审核的邮箱地址，以逗号分隔。留空则使用站点管理员邮箱。','Comma-separated list of allowed file extensions: %s. Leave blank to allow any.'=>'允许的文件扩展名列表，以逗号分隔：%s。留空表示允许任意扩展名。','Comment'=>'评论','Communications Consent'=>'通信同意','Compare With'=>'对比','Compare features'=>'比较功能','Compared to'=>'对比于','Configure the base settings for your events. These settings affect how events are stored and accessed in the database.'=>'配置活动的基础设置。这些设置会影响活动在数据库中的存储和访问方式。','Configure the base settings for your locations. These settings affect how locations are stored and accessed in the database.'=>'配置地点的基础设置。这些设置会影响地点在数据库中的存储和访问方式。','Confirm'=>'确认','Confirm button'=>'确认按钮','Confirmation email could not be sent to admin. Registrant should have gotten their email (only admin see this warning).'=>'确认邮件无法被寄至管理员。注册者应收到该邮件(只有管理员看得到这个警告)。','Confirmations'=>'确认','Confirmed'=>'确认','Confirmed Spaces'=>'已确认的席位','Confirmed booking email'=>'报名确认邮件','Congratulations! Your email settings work.'=>'祝贺你！你的邮件设置成功了。','Connect'=>'连接','Connect Events Manager to MCP-compatible AI clients (Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT custom connectors, VS Code, Codex) by exposing Events Manager Abilities through the WordPress MCP Adapter. Clients authenticate through a one-click consent screen and a refreshable Application Password — no manual key juggling.'=>'通过 WordPress MCP Adapter 开放 Events Manager 功能，将 Events Manager 连接到兼容 MCP 的 AI 客户端（Claude、Cursor、ChatGPT 自定义连接器、VS Code、Codex）。客户端通过一键授权界面和可刷新的应用程序密码进行身份验证，无需手动处理密钥。','Connect a %s account in the Events Manager settings before using it as an event location.'=>'请先在 Events Manager 设置中连接 %s 账户，然后再将其用作活动地址。','Connect an account'=>'连接账户','Connect to import events and locations from %s.'=>'连接以从 %s 导入活动和地点。','Consent'=>'同意','Consent %s on %s'=>'同意 %s 于 %s','Consent Error'=>'同意错误','Consent Text'=>'同意文本','Consent previously %s on %s'=>'此前已同意 %s 于 %s','Consented By Default'=>'默认同意','Contact a site administrator for your password.'=>'请联系站点管理员获取您的密码。','Content supplied within shortcode tags and the %s parameters will be HTML entity-decoded and sanitized.'=>'简码标签内提供的内容以及 %s 参数将进行 HTML 实体解码和净化。','Content supplied within shortcode tags like %s will be HTML entity-decoded.'=>'简码标签（如 %s）内提供的内容将进行 HTML 实体解码。','Control how subsites use Archetypes. Define network-wide types here and decide whether subsites can create, choose, or must use your list. You can also allow/deny renaming specific base settings.'=>'控制子站点如何使用原型。在此定义全网络通用的类型，并决定子站点是可以创建、选择，还是必须使用您的列表。您还可以允许/禁止重命名特定的基础设置。','Controls how many events being held at a location are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'控制使用 %s 等占位符时，每页显示在某个地点举行的活动数量。留空表示不限制。','Controls how many events belonging to a category are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'控制使用 %s 等占位符时，每页显示属于某个类别的活动数量。留空表示不限制。','Controls how many events belonging to a tag are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'控制使用 %s 等占位符时，每页显示属于某个标签的活动数量。留空表示不限制。','Convert ALL Repeating Events'=>'转换所有重复活动','Convert Recurring'=>'转换为定期活动','Convert and Deactivate Repeating Events'=>'转换并停用重复活动','Coordinates'=>'坐标','Copies your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from %s into Events Manager. Nothing in the original plugin is changed or deleted, so you can run this, check the result, and roll it back or run it again.'=>'将您的 %s 数据复制到 Events Manager。原插件中的任何内容都不会被更改或删除，因此您可以运行此操作、检查结果，然后回滚或再次运行。','Copy default value'=>'复制默认值','Copy over our new v6 formats to make the best of our new UI design!'=>'复制我们新的 v6 格式，充分利用我们全新的界面设计！','Cost'=>'费用','Could not check event validation. Saving without pre-check — please verify the event details.'=>'无法检查活动验证。将不经预先检查直接保存，请核实活动详情。','Could not open the PDF file for inspection.'=>'无法打开 PDF 文件进行检查。','Could not open the file for inspection.'=>'无法打开文件进行检查。','Could not read image size information.'=>'无法读取图像尺寸信息。','Count'=>'计数','Country'=>'国家','Coupons and discount codes'=>'优惠券和折扣码','Create %s'=>'创建%s','Create Zoom meetings and webinars from the event editor, and register attendees on Zoom when they book. With Pro, attendees are registered once they pay and receive their own join links.'=>'在活动编辑器中创建 Zoom 会议和网络研讨会，并在参会者报名时将其注册到 Zoom。使用 Pro 时，参会者在付款后即完成注册，并获得各自的加入链接。','Create a location or start typing to search a previously created location.'=>'创建一个位置或者输入搜索过去已被创建的地址。','Create booking'=>'创建报名','Create event'=>'创建活动','Create event ticket'=>