/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'尊敬的访客，<br/>我们很遗憾地通知您，#_EVENTNAME 在 #_EVENTDATES 的活动已被取消。<br/>此致敬礼，<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Decimal Point'=>'小数点','Decode shortcode content?'=>'解码简码内容？','Decode shortcode format parameters?'=>'解码简码格式参数？','Default'=>'默认','Default %s color'=>'默认 %s 颜色','Default %s list format'=>'默认 %s 列表格式','Default %s list options'=>'默认 %s 列表选项','Default (site setting)'=>'默认（站点设置）','Default Category'=>'默认类别','Default Country'=>'默认的国家','Default List Scope'=>'默认列表范围','Default Location'=>'默认位置','Default Location Country'=>'默认国家','Default Timezone'=>'默认时区','Default View'=>'默认视图','Default archive ordering'=>'默认存档次序','Default calendar size'=>'默认日历尺寸','Default distance'=>'默认距离','Default distance unit'=>'默认距离单位','Default event archive ordering'=>'默认活动存档次序','Default event list format'=>'默认活动列表格式','Default event list format footer'=>'默认活动列表模版页脚','Default event list format header'=>'默认活动列表格式标题','Default event list ordering'=>'默认活动列表次序','Default event style'=>'默认活动样式','Default font family'=>'默认字体','Default list ordering'=>'默认列表次序','Default map height'=>'默认地图高度','Default map width'=>'默认地图宽度','Default plugin setting'=>'插件默认设置','Default scope to show your events in shortcodes, widgets and any other displays where scope is not defined. Events page and archive scopes can be defined in the %s settings section.'=>'在简码、小工具以及其他未定义范围的显示位置中显示活动的默认范围。活动页面和归档页面的范围可在 %s 设置部分中定义。','Default: %s'=>'默认：%s','Delete'=>'删除','Delete %s'=>'删除%s','Delete User'=>'删除用户','Delete booking'=>'删除报名','Delete event'=>'删除活动','Delete everything migrated from %s (events, locations, tickets, bookings, terms) and restore converted content? The original data is not affected.'=>'删除从 %s 迁移的所有内容(活动、地点、门票、报名、分类项)并还原已转换的内容?原始数据不受影响。','Delete everything the import of %s created (events, locations, organizers, categories, tags and downloaded images)? Items that were already on the site are not affected.'=>'要删除 %s 的导入所创建的全部内容（活动、地址、组织者、类别、标签和已下载的图像）吗？站点上原有的项目不受影响。','Delete location'=>'删除地点','Delete selected'=>'删除选中的','Delete ticket'=>'删除门票','Deleted'=>'已删除','Deletes an Events Manager %s.'=>'删除一个 Events Manager %s。','Deletes an Events Manager ticket if it has no bookings.'=>'如果 Events Manager 门票没有报名，则将其删除。','Deletes or trashes an Events Manager event.'=>'删除或移至回收站一个 Events Manager 活动。','Deletes or trashes an Events Manager location.'=>'删除或移至回收站一个 Events Manager 地点。','Depending on server settings, some sending methods may ignore this settings.'=>'根据服务器设置，某些发送方法可能会忽略这个设置。','Depending on the nature of your site, you will be subject to one or more national and international privacy/data protection laws such as the %s. Below are some options that you can use to tailor how Events Manager interacts with WordPress privacy tools.'=>'根据您站点的性质，您将受到一项或多项国家和国际隐私/数据保护法律的约束，例如 %s。下面是一些选项，可用于调整 Events Manager 与 WordPress 隐私工具的交互方式。','Descending'=>'递减','Description'=>'描述','Detach'=>'分离','Details'=>'详细资料','Details about the event.'=>'关于此活动的详细信息。','Details about the location.'=>'位置详情','Detect User Country'=>'检测用户国家','Dev Mode active: Just a friendly reminder that you are updating to development versions. Only admins see this message, and it will go away when you disable this <a href="#pro-api">here</a> in your settings.'=>'Dev模式现行中：仅作为善意的提醒，你在更新开发版本。只有管理员可以看到这个信息，而在设置中当你<a href="#pro-api">在此</a>关闭这个信息它将消失。','Development Versions &amp; Updates'=>'开发版本 &amp; 更新','Difference from the price paid at the time of sale'=>'与销售时已付价格的差额','Direct Link'=>'直接链接','Disable'=>'停用','Disable  WordPress Thumbnails?'=>'停用 WordPress 缩略图？','Disable %s'=>'停用 %s','Disable new registration email?'=>'禁止新注册的电子邮件？','Disable thumbnails?'=>'禁用缩略图？','Disable title rewriting?'=>'标题不可改写？','Disabled'=>'已禁用','Disconnect'=>'断开连接','Disconnect All'=>'全部断开连接','Discounts (After Taxes)'=>'折扣(税后)','Discounts Before Taxes'=>'税前折扣','Dismiss'=>'忽略','Dismiss Message'=>'忽略消息','Disonnect'=>'断开连接','Display %s as'=>'显示 %s 作为','Display %s on your blog.'=>'在您的博客上显示 %s。','Display Settings'=>'显示设置','Display Status'=>'显示状态','Display a geolocation search textbox which syncs with the main search geolocation box (if enabled).'=>'显示与主搜索地理位置框同步的地理位置搜索文本框（如已启用）。','Display a list of event locations on Events Manager.'=>'在活动管理上显示活动地点列表','Display a list of events on Events Manager.'=>'在活动管理上显示一系列活动。','Display a prominent "Withdraw from contract" link in the site footer, since the law expects the function to be continuously and easily reachable.'=>'在站点页脚显示醒目的“撤销合同”链接，因为法律要求该功能可持续且便于访问。','Display booking summary?'=>'显示报名摘要？','Display calendar in events page?'=>'在活动页面中显示日历？','Display events on your blog.'=>'在您的博客中显示活动','Display free booking summary?'=>'显示免费报名摘要？','Display global %s on main blog?'=>'在主博客上显示全球 %s ？','Display global events on main blog?'=>'在博客主页中显示全球的活动','Display locations on your blog.'=>'在您的博客中显示位置','Display login form?'=>'显示登录表单？','Display on Frontend'=>'显示在前端','Display on WP Dashboard'=>'显示在 WP 仪表盘','Display on bookings dashboard'=>'显示在报名仪表盘','Display on event bookings admin'=>'显示在活动报名管理页','Display only locations with upcoming events.'=>'仅显示有即将举行活动的地点。','Display subsection titles above groups of line items, such as taxes, discounts and surcharges.'=>'在税费、折扣和附加费等分组明细项上方显示分节标题。','Display subsection titles?'=>'显示分节标题？','Display taxes separately?'=>'单独显示税费？','Display the booking summary if the event is free. If there are any available tickets worth more than 0 then the event is not considered free.'=>'活动免费时也显示报名摘要。如果有任何价格高于 0 的可用门票，则该活动不视为免费。','Display the number of available spaces (or booking status if full/closed/cancelled) in each timeslot button or dropdown option.'=>'在每个时段按钮或下拉选项中显示可用名额数量（如已满额、已关闭或已取消，则显示报名状态）。','Display the timeslot date as well as the time when viewing a specific calendar day.'=>'查看某个具体日历日期时，除时间外同时显示时段的日期。','Display ticket prices without tax and calculate the tax total separately.'=>'显示不含税的门票价格，并单独计算税费总额。','Display your events in a calendar widget.'=>'在日历部件里显示您的活动','Displaying %1$s&#8211;%2$s of %3$s'=>'显示 %1$s&#8211;%2$s 的 %3$s','Displays %s from all sites on the network by default. You can still restrict %s by blog using shortcodes and template tags coupled with the <code>blog</code> attribute. Requires global tables to be turned on.'=>'默认在全部的网络上的网站显示%s。你仍然可以限制%s博客，使用简码和模版标签和<code>博客</code>属性配合，需要全球表格来开启。','Displays a booking summary including itemized subtotals, taxes, discounts, surcharges and totals where applicable.'=>'显示报名摘要，包括适用的分项小计、税费、折扣、附加费和总计。','Distance Values'=>'距离值','Do not import'=>'不导入','Do not include'=>'不包含','Do you already have an account with us? %s'=>'您已经在我们这里注册账户了吗？%s','Document'=>'文档','Documentation'=>'文档','Don\'t have it? Leave this blank and we\'ll email you a secure link to choose your booking.'=>'没有编号？请留空，我们会通过邮件向您发送安全链接，供您选择报名。','Download %s'=>'下载%s','Download featured images given as web addresses'=>'下载以网址形式提供的精选图像','Draft'=>'草案','Drafts'=>'草稿','Dropdown Selection'=>'下拉选择','Due to how we change how this custom taxonomy is displayed when overriding with formats it is strongly advised that you assign a %s page below, which increases compatibility with various plugins and themes.'=>'由于使用形式覆盖时，我们会更改此自定义分类法的显示方式，强烈建议您在下方指定一个 %s 页面，以提高与各种插件和主题的兼容性。','Duplicate'=>'复制','Duplicate %s'=>'复制 %s','Duplicate this event'=>'重复此活动','Duplicating Events and Locations has been disabled by Events Manager, to avoid breaking data. You can use our Events Manager duplication features instead.'=>'为避免破坏数据，Events Manager 已禁用活动和地点的复制功能。您可以改用我们 Events Manager 的复制功能。','Duration'=>'持续时间','During'=>'期间','E-mail'=>'电子邮箱','E-mail: %s'=>'邮箱地址：%s','ERROR : Email Not Sent.'=>'错误：邮件未被发送。','Each event can have its own timezone if enabled. If set to no, then all newly created events will have the blog timezone, which currently is set to %s'=>'启用后，每个活动可以有自己的时区。如果设置为“否”，所有新创建的活动都将使用站点时区，当前设置为 %s','Earlier Dates'=>'更早日期','Edit'=>'编辑','Edit %s'=>'编辑 %s','Edit Booking'=>'编辑报名','Edit Details'=>'编辑详细信息','Edit Event'=>'编辑活动','Edit Event Category'=>'编辑活动类别','Edit Event Tag'=>'编辑活动标签','Edit Location'=>'编辑位置','Edit Recurring Event'=>'编辑定期活动','Edit Repeating 