启用定期活动？','Enable registration for this event'=>'为此活动登录','Enable repeated events?'=>'启用重复活动？','Enable right-of-withdrawal button?'=>'启用撤回权按钮？','Enable tags?'=>'启用标签？','Enabled'=>'已启用','Enabled (off by default)'=>'已启用（默认关闭）','Enabled (on by default)'=>'已启用（默认开启）','Enables additional advanced search fields such as dates, country, etc.'=>'启用其他高级搜索字段，例如日期、国家等。','Enabling this will prevent us from loading our CSS file on every page, and will only load on specific pages generated by Events Manager.'=>'启用后，我们将不再在每个页面上加载 CSS 文件，而仅在由 Events Manager 生成的特定页面上加载。','Encryption is always recommended if your SMTP server supports it. If your server supports TLS, this is also the most recommended method.'=>'如果您的 SMTP 服务器支持加密，始终建议启用。如果服务器支持 TLS，这也是最推荐的方式。','End'=>'结束','End Date'=>'结束日期','End Time'=>'结束时间','End date'=>'结束日期','End time'=>'结束时间','End time is required.'=>'结束时间是必须填写的。','Ends in %s'=>'%s 后结束','Enjoying Events Manager? Help Us Improve!'=>'喜欢 Events Manager 吗？帮助我们改进！','Enter a maximum number of spaces (required).'=>'输入一个最大数量的空间（必须填的）','Enter a number.'=>'输入一个数字。','Enter a ticket name.'=>'输入门票的名称','Enter the number of hours before an event starts for when users can cancel a booking. Leave blank for the start time of the event.'=>'输入活动开始前多少小时内用户可以取消报名。留空表示截至活动开始时间。','Enter your booking reference and email to withdraw. No account or login is required.'=>'请输入您的报名编号和邮箱以撤销报名。无需账户或登录。','Error mailing user'=>'错误邮件用户','Error uploading file, please try again!'=>'上传文件出错，请重试！','Errors'=>'错误','Event'=>'活动','Event Admin Emails'=>'活动管理员电子邮件','Event Admin/Owner Emails'=>'活动管理员/所有者电子邮件','Event Approved'=>'被批准的活动','Event Bookings Dashboard'=>'活动报名控制面板','Event Cancellation'=>'活动取消','Event Categories'=>'活动类别','Event Category'=>'活动类别','Event Date(s)'=>'活动日期','Event Dates'=>'活动日期','Event Dates '=>'活动日期 ','Event Details'=>'活动细节','Event Edit and Submission Forms'=>'活动编辑和提交表单','Event ID or event ID with timeslot suffix.'=>'活动 ID，或带有时间段后缀的活动 ID。','Event ID.'=>'活动 ID。','Event Image'=>'活动图片','Event List Limits'=>'活动列表限制','Event Location Placeholders'=>'活动地点占位符','Event Locations'=>'活动地点','Event Manager Options'=>'活动管理选项','Event Manager titles'=>'活动管理标题','Event Name'=>'活动名称','Event Options'=>'事件选项','Event Preview Mode'=>'活动预览模式','Event Published'=>'活动已发布','Event Re-Submitted'=>'活动重新提交','Event Reapproved'=>'事件重新批准','Event Related Placeholders'=>'和活动相关的占位符','Event Status'=>'活动状态','Event Style'=>'活动样式','Event Submission Forms'=>'活动发送表单','Event Submission Templates'=>'活动提交表单','Event Submitted'=>'发送活动','Event Submitter Emails'=>'活动提交者电子邮件','Event Summary'=>'活动摘要','Event Tag'=>'活动标签','Event Tags'=>'活动标签','Event Tickets Plus sells tickets as WooCommerce products. Linking keeps each booking attached to its original WooCommerce order.'=>'Event Tickets Plus 将门票作为 WooCommerce 产品出售。关联后,每个报名将保持关联其原始 WooCommerce 订单。','Event Time(s)'=>'活动时间','Event Type'=>'活动类型','Event and venue descriptions'=>'活动和场地描述','Event approved email'=>'被批准活动的电子邮箱地址','Event approved subject'=>'被批准活动的主题','Event archives scope'=>'活动归档范围','Event attached to %s.'=>'活动已关联到%s。','Event booking forms'=>'活动报名表单','Event cancelled'=>'活动已取消','Event cancelled '=>'活动已取消 ','Event categories'=>'活动类别','Event could not be attached.'=>'活动无法被合并。','Event could not be deleted.'=>'无法删除活动。','Event could not be detached.'=>'活动无法分离。','Event could not be saved.'=>'无法保存活动。','Event data is invalid.'=>'活动数据无效。','Event detached.'=>'活动分离','Event format'=>'活动格式','Event fully booked'=>'活动预定已满额','Event is fully booked.'=>'活动订购已满额','Event list scope'=>'活动列表范围','Event modal preview format'=>'活动模态框预览格式','Event name'=>'活动名称','Event not found, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'未找到活动，因此上传的图片未被设为其特色图片。','Event not found.'=>'未找到活动。','Event pages'=>'活动页面','Event published email'=>'活动发布的邮件','Event published subject'=>'活动发布的主题','Event re-attached to %s.'=>'活动已重新关联到%s。','Event reapproved email'=>'活动被重新批准的电子邮箱地址','Event reapproved subject'=>'活动被重新批准的主题','Event registration and booking management for WordPress. Recurring events, locations, webinars, google maps, rss, ical, booking registration and more!'=>'WordPress 活动注册与报名管理。支持定期活动、地点、网络研讨会、Google 地图、RSS、iCal、报名注册等功能！','Event resubmitted email'=>'活动重新提交的邮件','Event resubmitted subject'=>'活动被重新提交的主题','Event start date/time, location name'=>'活动开始日期/时间，未知名称','Event style'=>'活动样式','Event submission notifications will be sent to emails added here.'=>'活动发布通知将被寄到加入在此的电子邮箱。','Event submitted email'=>'活动提交了的邮件','Event submitted subject'=>'发送提交了的主题','Event timezones for blog %s have been reset to %s.'=>'博客 %s 的活动时区已重置为 %s。','Event timezones have been reset to %s.'=>'活动时区已重置为 %s。','Event timezones on all blogs have been reset to %s.'=>'所有博客的活动时区已重置为 %s。','Event title format'=>'活动标题格式','Event tooltip preview format'=>'活动工具提示预览格式','Event tooltips format'=>'活动提示格式','Event website'=>'活动网站','Event.'=>'活动。','Event/Location admin pages'=>'活动/地点管理页面','Eventful Locations?'=>'有活动的地点？','Events'=>'活动','Events Calendar'=>'活动日历','Events Duration'=>'活动持续时间','Events I\'m Attending'=>'我正在参与的活动','Events Manager'=>'活动管理','Events Manager - %s'=>'Events Manager - %s','Events Manager 5.9 introduced timezone functionality, which does not require certain fields in your database. To maintain backwards compatibility with earlier versions, these fields will still be created.'=>'Events Manager 5.9 引入了时区功能，该功能不再需要数据库中的某些字段。为了保持与早期版本的向后兼容，这些字段仍会被创建。','Events Manager 6 onwards has optional styling that maximizes consistency accross different themes. If you\'d like your theme to take over in some or all aspects of our plugin, you can disable our styling here.'=>'Events Manager 6 及更高版本提供可选样式，可最大程度地保持不同主题之间的一致性。如果您希望由主题接管我们插件的部分或全部样式，可以在此处停用我们的样式。','Events Manager Add-ons'=>'Events Manager 附加组件','Events Manager Bookings'=>'Events Manager 报名','Events Manager Data'=>'Events Manager 数据','Events Manager Management'=>'Events Manager 管理','Events Manager Pro'=>'Events Manager Pro','Events Manager Pro %s has received a major security update. Please <a href="%s">read our announcement</a> and log into your account for upgrade options.'=>'Events Manager Pro %s 收到了一次重大安全更新。请<a href="%s">阅读我们的公告</a>并登录您的账户查看升级选项。','Events Manager Settings'=>'活动管理设置','Events Manager Test Email'=>'活动管理测试邮件','Events Manager app'=>'Events Manager 应用','Events Manager bookings'=>'Events Manager 报名','Events Manager bookings linked to their WooCommerce orders (Events Manager for WooCommerce)'=>'已关联 WooCommerce 订单的 Events Manager 报名(Events Manager for WooCommerce)','Events Manager can copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from %1$s. Nothing in %1$s is changed, so you can check the result before switching it off.'=>'Events Manager 可以复制您在 %1$s 中的活动、场地、组织者、门票和参会者。%1$s 中的任何内容都不会被更改，因此您可以在将其关闭之前检查结果。','Events Manager can now show you the latest stable release as soon as it is published, we <b>strongly</b> recommend you do this. Enable this under %1$s. %2$s'=>'Events Manager 现在可以在最新稳定版发布后立即向您显示，我们<b>强烈</b>建议您启用此功能。请在 %1$s 下启用。%2$s','Events Manager cannot be uninstalled from this site.'=>'无法从此站点卸载 Events Manager。','Events Manager for WooCommerce'=>'Events Manager for WooCommerce','Events Manager found events from %s on this site and can copy them, with their venues, organizers, tickets and attendees.'=>'Events Manager 在此站点上发现了来自 %s 的活动,可以将其连同场地、组织者、门票和参会者一起复制。','Events Manager has been maintained, developed and supported for free since it was released in 2008, positive reviews are one that help us keep going.'=>'自 2008 年发布以来，Events Manager 一直免费维护、开发并提供支持，好评能帮助我们继续前行。','Events Manager has implemented multiple ways to help prevent or reduce these costs drastically, please check our %s page for more information.'=>'Events Manager 已采取多种方式帮助您避免或大幅降低这些费用，更多信息请查看我们的%s页面。','Events Manager has introduced location types, which can include online locations such as a URL or integrations with webinar platforms such as Zoom! Enable different location types in your settings page, for more information see our %s.'=>'Events Manager 引入了地点类型，其中可以包括网址等线上地点，或与 Zoom 等网络研讨会平台的集成！请在设置页面中启用不同的地点类型，更多信息请参阅我们的%s。','Events Manager has introduced new privacy tools to help you comply with international laws such as the GDPR, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a> for more information.'=>'Events Manager 推出了新的隐私工具，帮助您遵守 GDPR 等国际法律，更多信息请<a href="%s">参阅我们的文档</a>。','Events Manager has no rule for %1$s, so this was imported as %2$d date.'=>'Events Manager 暂无适用于 %1$s 的规则，因此已将其导入为包含 %2$d 个日期的列表。','Events Manager has no rule for %s.'=>'Events Manager 暂无适用于 %s 的规则。','Events Manager has no rule for these yet. Such rows are imported as a list of dates, or skipped if you choose that, and the result report names each one.'=>'Events Manager 暂时没有这些规则。此类行将作为日期列表导入，如果您选择跳过，则会被跳过，结果报告会列出每一行。','Events Manager now has a <a href="">mobile app</a> 🥳 🎉, download it now!'=>'Events Manager 现已推出<a href="">移动应用</a> 🥳 🎉，立即下载！','Events Manager now supports multiple timezones for your events! Your events will initially match your blog timezone.'=>'Events Manager 现在支持为您的活动设置多个时区！您的活动最初将与您的博客时区一致。','Events Manager repeats daily, weekly, monthly on a weekday such as the second Tuesday, and yearly, up to an end date. It has no rule for a day of the month or for ending after a number of times. Either way the result report names each row.'=>'Events Manager 支持每天、每周、在某个星期几（例如第二个星期二）每月以及每年重复，直至结束日期。它没有按每月某一天重复或在重复指定次数后结束的规则。无论哪种情况，结果报告都会列出每一行。','Events Manager tools — create and manage events, bookings, locations, tickets and media — for MCP-compatible AI clients.'=>'Events Manager 工具：为兼容 MCP 的 AI 客户端创建和管理活动、报名、地点、门票和媒体。','Events Manager validation errors from the last save, if any.'=>'上次保存时的 Events Manager 验证错误（如有）。','Events Manager was not uninstalled. This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'Events Manager 未被卸载。此网络共用一套活动和报名数据表，从此站点卸载会永久删除网络中所有站点的活动和报名。请改为从%s卸载。','Events Manager\'s permalink settings are changed to match, so links to your events keep working without redirects.'=>'Events Manager 的固定链接设置会随之更改，因此指向您活动的链接无需重定向即可继续使用。','Events Types (Archetypes)'=>'活动类型（原型）','Events With Bookings Enabled'=>'已有报名的活动','Events can choose their own?'=>'活动可以自行选择吗？','Events can have a status associated with them, such as a cancelled event, which can then be filtered out of search listings. By default, or if disabled, events have an %s status.'=>'活动可以有关联的状态，例如已取消的活动，这样即可将其从搜索列表中过滤掉。默认情况下，或在停用时，活动的状态为 %s。','Events can have multiple times per day, the timeslots can be selected from booking forms, timeslots do not have their own event page and are housed under the same event.'=>'活动每天可以有多个时间，可在报名表单中选择时段，时段没有各自的活动页面，而是归属于同一个活动。','Events cannot start after they end.'=>'活动在结束后无法开始。','Events current and next month'=>'当前及下月的活动','Events date modal preview format'=>'活动日期模态框预览格式','Events imported from CSV files'=>'从 CSV 文件导入的活动','Events list page'=>'活动列表页面','Events list settings'=>'活动列表设置','Events next month'=>'下月的活动','Events on %s'=>'%s 的活动','Events page'=>'活动页面','Events per day'=>'每天活动数','Events require a user to own them. In order to allow events to be submitted anonymously you need to assign that event a specific user. We recommend you create a "Anonymous" subscriber with a very good password and use that. Guests will have the same event permissions as this user when submitting.'=>'活动要求使用者独有他们。为了让活动能匿名地发送，你需要分配这个活动给特定地用户。我们建议你创建一个"匿名"订阅户并且设置一个很好的密码来使用。客户将会有和这个用户相同的活动许可','Events this month'=>'本月的活动','Events this month (today onwards)'=>'本月活动（今天起）','Events this week (today to %s)'=>'本周活动（今天至 %s）','Events this whole week (%s to %s)'=>'本周全部活动（%s 至 %s）','Events with multiple dates will appear on each of those dates in the calendar.'=>'有多个日期的活动将显示在日历中的每个日期上。','Events with timeslots can further break up timeslots dynamically by adding timeslot durations, buffers and frequencies to create multiple timeslots from one time range. For example, in the mornings, you can have a timeslot every 45 minutes at the start of each hour.'=>'带有时段的活动可以通过添加时段时长、间隔和频率，进一步动态拆分时段，从一个时间范围创建多个时段。例如，在上午，你可以在每个整点开始后每 45 分钟设置一个时段。','Events within 12 months'=>'12个月之内的活动','Events within 2 months'=>'2个月之内的活动','Events within 3 months'=>'3个月之内的活动','Events within 6 months'=>'6个月之内的活动','Events won\'t recurr on the following dates:'=>'活动不会在以下日期重复：','Every Minute'=>'每分钟','Everyone'=>'大家','Everyone else sees the link text without the link. Attendees whose booking includes virtual access get their own join link once the booking is approved. Without bookings, the link is always shown.'=>'其他所有人只会看到不带链接的链接文字。报名包含虚拟参与权限的参会者在报名获批后会获得各自的加入链接。没有报名时，始终显示链接。','Everything in Pro'=>'Pro 中的全部功能','Everything in Pro, plus every add-on listed here, on a single license.'=>'Pro 中的全部功能，外加此处列出的所有附加组件，只需一个许可证。','Everything on %s is public, so the link appears on the event page and in calendar feeds.'=>'%s 上的所有内容都是公开的，因此链接会显示在活动页面和日历订阅源中。','Example Input'=>'输入示例','Example:'=>'例子：','Excerpt'=>'摘要','Exclude %s'=>'排除%s','Exclude Countries'=>'排除的国家','Exclude on'=>'排除于','Exclude taxes from subtotal?'=>'小计不含税费？','Expand All'=>'展开所有','Export'=>'导出','Export Bookings'=>'导出报名','Export CSV'=>'导出 CSV','Export Settings'=>'导出设置','Export these bookings.'=>'导出这些报名','Export your Events Manager settings and restore them here or on another website running this plugin.'=>'导出您的 Events Manager 设置，并在此处或运行此插件的其他网站上恢复。','Exported on %s'=>'导出于 %s','Exporter'=>'导出器','Failed to write upload to temporary file.'=>'无法将上传内容写入临时文件。','Fallback panels'=>'备用面板','Featured'=>'精选','Featured (yes or no)'=>'精选（yes 或 no）','Featured image (web address or media ID)'=>'精选图像（网址或媒体 ID）','Fields marked * are needed. A field can be given to one column only.'=>'标有 * 的字段为必填。一个字段只能指定给一列。','File'=>'文件','File Type'=>'文件类型','File upload is required'=>'必须上传文件','File upload is required.'=>'必须上传文件。','Finalize Timezones Upgrade'=>'完成时区升级','Find more dates from the calendar.'=>'从日历中查看更多日期。','Finished'=>'已完成','Finishing'=>'正在完成','First Name'=>'名','First page'=>'首页','First row'=>'第一行','For monthly: first, second, third, fourth or last.'=>'适用于 monthly：first、second、third、fourth 或 last。','For more information see our %s.'=>'更多信息请参阅我们的%s。','For more information see our <a href="%s">data privacy documentation</a>.'=>'更多信息请参阅我们的<a href="%s">数据隐私文档</a>。','For multiple emails, separate by commas (e.g. email1@test.com,email2@test.com,etc.)'=>'对多个邮箱地址，用逗号分开 （例如：email1@test.com,email2@test.com）','For use with the %s placeholder'=>'为和 %s 占位符使用','For weekly: one or more, such as Mon, Wed. For monthly: one, used with the week of the month.'=>'适用于 weekly：一个或多个，例如 Mon、Wed。适用于 monthly：一个，与当月的第几周配合使用。','For when start/end %s are present, this will separate the two (include spaces here if necessary).'=>'当开始/结束 %s 一起出现时，他们将被分为两个（必要时包括空格）','Force network-defined list (no subsite choice)'=>'强制使用网络定义的列表（子站点不可选择）','Formatting'=>'格式化','Found %d orphaned events, deleted %d successfully'=>'发现 %d 个孤立活动，已成功删除 %d 个','Found in %s'=>'在 %s 中找到','Free'=>'免费','Free companion plugins'=>'免费配套插件','Free plugins from the Events Manager team, available on WordPress.org.'=>'Events Manager 团队提供的免费插件，可在 WordPress.org 获取。','Frequency'=>'频率','From '=>'从 ','From %1$s to %2$s'=>'从 %1$s 到 %2$s','From %s a year'=>'每年 %s 起','Front-end management pages'=>'前端管理页面','Full Calendar Options'=>'Full Calendar 选项','Full-Size Calendar'=>'全尺寸日历','Fully Booked'=>'满额','Fully booked'=>'满额','Further Information'=>'更多信息','Future'=>'将来','Future Events Only?'=>'仅限将来的活动？','Future events'=>'将来的活动','Future events only'=>'仅限将来的活动','Gather panels that can\'t run in the canvas into a tabbed "Event Details" box'=>'将无法在画布中运行的面板收集到一个选项卡式的“活动细节”框中','General'=>'常规','General JS'=>'通用 JS','General Options'=>'通用选项','General settings'=>'常规设置','Geolocation Search'=>'地理位置搜索','Get %s'=>'获取%s','Get booking'=>'获取报名','Get booking requirements'=>'获取报名要求','Get event'=>'获取活动','Get event availability'=>'获取活动余量','Get location'=>'获取地点','Get ticket'=>'获取门票','Getting Help for Events Manager'=>'从活动管理员那儿获取帮助','Give each date of a recurring event its own meeting link'=>'为定期活动的每个日期提供各自的会议链接','Give the file to import with --file=<path>.'=>'使用 --file=<path> 指定要导入的文件。','Global %s slug'=>'全球 %s slug','Global Map Format'=>'全球地图格式','Google Calendar'=>'Google 日历','Google Map Type'=>'Google 地图类型','Google Maps API Browser Key'=>'Google Maps API 浏览器密钥','Google Maps API provides you with ways to display maps of your locations and help site visitors find events near their desired locations.'=>'Google Maps API 为你提供显示位置地图的方式，并帮助站点访客查找其所需位置附近的活动。','Google Maps Style'=>'Google 地图样式','Google Maps Styling Wizard'=>'Google 地图样式向导','Google Maps and Location Services'=>'Google 地图和位置服务','Google Maps require an API key, please see our %s page for instructions on obtaining one.'=>'Google 地图需要 API 密钥，获取方法请参阅我们的%s页面。','Google has introduced new pricing for displaying maps on your site. If you have moderate traffic levels, this may likely affect you with surprise and unexpected costs!'=>'Google 推出了在您的站点上显示地图的新定价。如果您的流量处于中等水平，可能会因此产生意想不到的费用！','Google may charge you for usage, depending on how much traffic your site receives. For more information about how and where Events Manager uses the Google Maps API, and how to manage costs, please see our %s page.'=>'Google 可能会根据你站点的流量对使用收取费用。有关 Events Manager 如何以及在何处使用 Google Maps API，以及如何控制成本，请参阅我们的%s页面。','Google offers different map displays, each with varying prices and free usage allowance. See our %s page for more information on these display options.'=>'Google 提供不同的地图显示方式，各自的价格和免费使用额度不同。有关这些显示选项的更多信息，请参阅我们的%s页面。','Grid'=>'网格','Group By'=>'分组依据','Group Events'=>'团体活动','Group Ownership'=>'组别所有权','Grouped Lists'=>'分组列表','Grouped Lists View'=>'分组列表视图','Grouped list default'=>'分组列表默认值','Grouped list format'=>'分组列表格式','Grouped list header'=>'分组列表标题','Guest Default User'=>'游客默认用户','Guest User'=>'客户','Guest Users'=>'客人 用户','HTML Allowed.'=>'HTML允许。','HTML allowed.'=>'HTML允许。','HTML entity-decoded shortcode content will be sanitized after being decoded, we STRONGLY recommend leaving this enabled.'=>'经 HTML 实体解码的简码内容将在解码后进行净化，强烈建议保持启用。','HTML is not accepted.'=>'不接受 HTML。','Headings'=>'标题','Help'=>'帮助','Here you can disable individual item styling eompletely or just allow basic styling. Basic styling will try to impose general structuring (such as calendar structures) but won\'t use our Strict styling rules.'=>'您可以在此完全停用单个项目的样式，或仅允许基本样式。基本样式会尝试应用通用结构（例如日历结构），但不会使用我们的严格样式规则。','Hidden Links'=>'隐藏链接','Hidden by default?'=>'默认隐藏？','Hidden from listings (yes or no)'=>'在列表中隐藏（yes 或 no）','Hidden from upcoming'=>'在即将举行的活动中隐藏','Hidden link text'=>'隐藏链接文字','Hidden links'=>'隐藏链接','Hide'=>'隐藏','Hide Advanced Options'=>'隐藏高级选项','Hide Advanced Search'=>'隐藏高级搜索','Hide Search'=>'隐藏搜索','Hide form until tickets selected?'=>'选择门票前隐藏表单？','Hide label'=>'隐藏标签','Hide link until %s minutes before the event starts'=>'在活动开始前 %s 分钟之前隐藏链接','Hide on %s screen size?'=>'在%s屏幕尺寸下隐藏？','Hold spaces while booking?'=>'报名时保留名额？','Hold time'=>'保留时间','Holds'=>'保留','Host account'=>'主办账户','Hosted by %s'=>'主办方：%s','Hours'=>'小时','How events appear on each calendar day: a labelled pill per event, a single dot, one dot per event (up to the day limit), or a coloured ring around the date. Override per calendar with the %s parameter.'=>'活动在每个日历日期上的显示方式：每个活动一个带标签的胶囊、单个圆点、每个活动一个圆点（最多至每日上限），或日期周围的彩色圆环。可通过 %s 参数为单个日历覆盖此设置。','How long before an event can users cancel?'=>'用户可在活动前多久取消？','How many minutes before an event starts its link is shown, when the event has no time of its own.'=>'当活动没有自己的时间时，在活动开始前多少分钟显示其链接。','How many minutes the picked spaces are held for a visitor who has not submitted their booking yet.'=>'尚未提交报名的访客所选名额的保留分钟数。','How the first rows will import with the columns and options as last previewed. Nothing has been saved yet.'=>'按最近预览的列和选项，前几行的导入效果如下。尚未保存任何内容。','However, there were some problems whilst sending confirmation emails to you and/or the event contact person. You may want to contact them directly and letting them know of this error.'=>'在系统发给您和/或活动联系人确认邮件的时候出了些问题。您可能想要直接联系他们或让他们知道这个错误。','Hundreds of free hours have gone into making this free plugin, show your support and add a small link to the plugin website at the bottom of your event pages.'=>'我们制作这个免费的插件花费了数百个小时，如果您想显示对我们的支持，请在您的活动页面的底部添加一个链接至插件网站的小链接。','Hybrid'=>'混合','Hybrid (Physical/Virtual)'=>'混合（实体/虚拟）','Hybrid Venue (Physical/Virtual)'=>'混合场地（实体/虚拟）','I consent to my submitted data being collected and stored as outlined by the site %s.'=>'我同意按照站点%s所述收集和存储我提交的数据。','I consent to the use of my provided contact information for communication purposes.'=>'我同意将我提供的联系信息用于沟通目的。','I hereby withdraw from the contract for the following booking: %1$s (#%2$d).'=>'本人特此撤销以下报名的合同：%1$s (#%2$d)。','ID'=>'ID','IP: %s'=>'IP：%s','Icon to appear in dashboard admin menu for this Archetype. Accepts URLs to PNG/SVG images, %s or leave blank for default.'=>'此原型在仪表盘管理菜单中显示的图标。接受 PNG/SVG 图片网址、%s，或留空使用默认图标。','If File Type is also set, only these extensions within the permitted File Type will be permitted.'=>'如果同时设置了文件类型，则只允许所选文件类型范围内的这些扩展名。','If HTML emails are enabled, br tags will automatically be added for new lines.'=>'如果HTML邮件被启动，br标签会自动的被加入到新的横线上。','If a booking exists for that email address, we have sent a link to manage your withdrawal. Please check your inbox.'=>'如果该邮箱地址存在报名，我们已发送了管理撤销的链接。请查收您的收件箱。','If a booking is made and an email cannot be sent, this is added to the success message.'=>'若下单成功但电子邮件无法发送，这份报名将会被归到成功信息里。','If a calendar day has only one event, you can force a direct link to the event (recommended to avoid duplicate content).'=>'如果一个日历天只有一个活动，你可以强制一个直接联接到这个活动（推荐使用，来避免重复的内容）。','If a user has not previously given or revoked consent for a specific submitted data type (such as bookings), do we assume user has given consent by default?'=>'如果用户此前未针对特定提交数据类型（例如报名）给出或撤销同意，我们是否默认假定用户已同意？','If already attending and double bookings are disabled, this message will be displayed, followed by a link to the users booking page.'=>'如果您已经正在参与并且解除了重复订购，这条信息将会显示，后面会跟着一个至用户订购页面的链接。','If an event does not have a category assigned when editing, this one will be assigned automatically.'=>'如果在编辑的时候一个活动没有被分配类别，这个类别将自动的被分配。','If an event is cancelled, the following actions can be taken upon cancellation.'=>'活动被取消时，可以执行以下操作。','If an event is cancelled, you can exclude them from event lists. You can display cancelled events in shortcode using the %s parameter.'=>'如果活动已被取消，您可以将其从活动列表中排除。您可以在简码中使用 %s 参数显示已取消的活动。','If an event lasts all day, this text will show if using the %s placeholder'=>'如果一项活动持续一整天，在使用 %s 占位符后将出现此文本','If checked every booking must select one or the minimum number of this ticket.'=>'如果选择，每个预定必须选择一个或者这个门票限定的最低数量。','If enabled replies to these automated emails will be sent to the person who made the booking. This takes precedence over the event owner Reply-To.'=>'启用后，对这些自动电子邮件的回复将发送给报名者。此项优先于活动所有者回复地址。','If enabled replies to these automated emails will, by default, be sent to the email of the event owner.'=>'启用后，对这些自动电子邮件的回复默认会发送到活动所有者的邮箱。','If enabled, Events Manager checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release rather than waiting for the staggered update rollout, which can take up to 24 hours. Releases found this way are shown for a manual update only and are never auto-installed, unless you define the %1$s constant. %2$s'=>'启用后，Events Manager 会直接向 WordPress.org 检查最新稳定版本，而无需等待可能长达 24 小时的分批更新推送。以此方式发现的版本仅提示手动更新，绝不会自动安装，除非您定义了 %1$s 常量。%2$s','If enabled, fully booked timeslots remain visible but cannot be selected.'=>'启用后，已满额的时段仍会显示，但无法选择。','If enabled, guest visitors can supply an email address and a user account will automatically be created for them along with their booking. They will be also be able to log back in with that newly created account.'=>'如果该设置启用，游客可以提供一个邮箱地址，这样，一个用户账户将与报名一起自动被创建。他们也能用这个新创建的账户重新登录。','If enabled, the entire booking form will show once a space is selected, or if an ticket is already pre-selected with minimum spaces.'=>'启用后，选择名额后，或已预先选择了满足最少名额要求的门票时，才会显示完整的报名表单。','If enabled, the latest dev version will always be checked instead of the latest stable version of the plugin.'=>'如果开启了，最新的插件dev版本将总是替代最新的插件稳定版本被查看。','If enabled, the spaces a visitor picks on the booking form are held for them while they fill in the rest of the form, so nobody else can take them before they submit. Held spaces count as taken for everyone else until the booking is submitted or the hold runs out. A hold can be no larger than one booking, so set a maximum number of spaces per booking on your events or tickets to limit how much of an event one visitor can hold.'=>'启用后，访客在报名表单上选择的名额会在其填写表单其余部分期间为其保留，避免其他人在提交前占用。在报名提交或保留时间结束之前，保留的名额对其他人而言视为已占用。保留的名额不能超过一次报名，因此请在活动或门票上设置每次报名的最大名额数，以限制单个访客可保留活动的多少名额。','If enabled, users can book an event more than once.'=>'如果该设置启用，用户可以不止一次地订购同一个活动。','If enabled, users can cancel their bookings themselves from their bookings page.'=>'一般情况下，用户可以自行从他们的报名页面上将报名取消。','If guests cannot make bookings, they will be asked to register in order to book. However, enabling this will still show available tickets.'=>'如果访客无法报名，他们需要先注册才能报名。不过，启用此项后仍会显示可用的门票。','If inclusion rules are entered above, this setting is ignored.'=>'如果上方已输入包含规则，则忽略此设置。','If left blank, no emails will be sent. Separate emails with commas for more than one email.'=>'如果不填写邮箱地址，将没有电子邮件寄出。若有一个以上的邮箱地址，请以逗号隔开。','If left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'如果留空，将使用默认值。','If left blank, this email will not be sent.'=>'如果不填写，这个邮件将不会被寄出。','If set to yes the capabilities will be applied all your network blogs and you will not be able to set custom capabilities each blog. You can select no later and visit specific blog settings pages to add/remove capabilities.'=>'如果设置成“是”，这个功能将适用于你所有的网络博客，你将不能设置每个博客的个性化功能。你可以以后选择“否”，然后访问个别的博客设置页面来添加／删除功能。','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of events.'=>'如果设置为是的，在您的活动列表上方将出现一个搜索表单。','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of locations.'=>'如果设置为是，地点列表上方将显示一个搜索表单。','If set to yes, advanced search fields can toggled by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'如果设置为“是”，点击“高级搜索”图标即可切换高级搜索字段的显示。','If set to yes, advanced search fields will be hidden by default and can be revealed by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'如果设置为“是”，高级搜索字段将默认隐藏，点击“高级搜索”图标即可显示。','If set to yes, full sized images will be used and HTML width and height attributes will be used to determine the size.'=>'如果设置为是，将使用全尺寸图片，并使用 HTML 的宽度和高度属性来确定尺寸。','If set to yes, the FullCalendar will be used instead of the standard calendar on the events page.'=>'如果设置为是，活动页面上将使用 FullCalendar 代替标准日历。','If set to yes, your emails will be sent in HTML format, otherwise plaintext.'=>'如果设置为是的，您的电子邮件将以HTML格式放，否则将无内容。','If set, the total number of spaces for a single booking to this event cannot exceed this amount.'=>'如果设置，单次报名此活动的名额总数不能超过该数值。','If syncing is turned on for a booking status below, when a user RSVPs, the booking status will automatically be changed along with RSVP status.'=>'如果下方为某个报名状态开启了同步，则用户回复邀请时，报名状态会随回复邀请状态自动更改。','If the booking is free, this will be displayed instead of the %s heading.'=>'如果报名免费，将显示此项，而不是 %s 标题。','If the consent checkbox is not checked during a booking, this error will be returned.'=>'如果报名时未勾选同意复选框，将返回此错误。','If the consent checkbox is not checked when submitting information such as events or locations, this error will be returned.'=>'如果在提交活动或地点等信息时未勾选同意复选框，将返回此错误。','If the user made a previous booking and cannot double-book.'=>'如果用户之前下过报名则无法重复下同一份报名。','If the user tries to make a booking with spaces that exceeds the maximum number of spaces per booking.'=>'如果用户尝试报名的名额超过每次报名的最大名额。','If the user tries to make a booking without requesting any spaces.'=>'如果用户试图在不扩展任何席位的情况下下报名。','If there are any new updates, you should now see them in your Plugins or Updates admin pages.'=>'如果有任何新的更新，您现在应该在您的插件或管理员更新页面中看到他们了。','If there are member-only tickets, you can choose whether or not to show these tickets to guests.'=>'如果存在仅限会员的门票，你可以选择是否向访客显示这些门票。','If there\'s no fields to show in the main search section, this button will be used instead at the bottom of the advanced fields.'=>'如果主搜索区域没有可显示的字段，则会在高级字段底部改用此按钮。','If this is incorrect, click cancel and try a more specific address.'=>'如果有误，请点击取消并尝试输入更具体的地址。','If translations are left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'如果翻译留空，将使用默认值。','If viewing a page for events on a specific date, this is the title that would show up. To insert date values, use <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">PHP time format characters</a>  with a <code>#</code> symbol before them, i.e. <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, etc.<br/>'=>'如果查看页面显示 某个具体日期的活动，这个标题将出现。插入日期值，使用<a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">PHP time format characters</a>  with a <code>#</code> symbol before them, i.e. <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, etc.<br/>','If you are experiencing errors when trying to use any of these accounts, try disconnecting and connecting again.'=>'如果您在尝试使用其中任何账户时遇到错误,请尝试断开连接后重新连接。','If you change time patterns such as start times or durations, any previously created timeslots falling outside the new settings will be %s.'=>'如果您更改开始时间或持续时间等时间样式，落在新设置之外的任何已创建时段都将%s。','If you choose \'Pages\' then %s will be shown using your theme default page template, alternatively choose from page templates that come with your specific theme.'=>'如果选择“页面”，%s 将使用您主题的默认页面模板显示；您也可以从所用主题自带的页面模板中选择。','If you choose a group by mode, your events page will display events in groups of your chosen time range.'=>'如果你通过模式选择一个组，你的活动页面将以你选择的时间范围为队列显示活动。','If you choose the Event post type whilst Events Manager is activated, you can also visit the <a href="%s">Events Manager settings page</a> for a few more options when displaying event information on your calendar.'=>'如果在启用 Events Manager 的情况下选择活动文章类型，您还可以访问 <a href="%s">Events Manager 设置页面</a>，获取更多在日历上显示活动信息的选项。','If you choose to cancel your event, after you save this event, no further bookings will be possible for this event.'=>'如果您选择取消活动，保存此活动后，将无法再对此活动进行报名。','If you collect personal data, you may want to request their consent. The options below will automatically add checkboxes requesting this consent.'=>'如果您收集个人数据，可能需要征得用户同意。下面的选项会自动添加请求此同意的复选框。','If you could spare a few minutes, we would appreciate it if you could please leave us a review.'=>'如果您能抽出几分钟时间，我们将非常感谢您给我们留下评价。','If you disable locations, bear in mind that you should remove your location page, shortcodes and related placeholders from your <a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">formats</a>.'=>'如果你关闭位置功能，注意你必须在<a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">格式页面</a>删除你的位置页面，简码和相关的占位符。','If you enable tips, this information will be shown, which can include HTML.'=>'如果启用提示，将显示此信息，其中可以包含 HTML。','If you extend or add more dates, the new recurrences will be added to your recurrence set without affecting previously created ones.'=>'如果您延长或添加更多日期，新的重复活动将添加到您的重复活动集中，而不会影响之前创建的活动。','If you extend or add more times, this will not affect previous timeslots.'=>'如果您延长或添加更多时间，不会影响之前的时段。','If you get a lot of pending bookings and you decide to allow more bookings than spaces allow, setting this to yes will allow you to override the event space limit when manually approving.'=>'如果你有很多待定的预订，而你决定允许比计划的名位更多的预订时，将此设置成yes将允许你人工批准废除活动名位的限制。','If you hare happy with the migration, you can dismiss this message and your old formatting options (i.e. this undo option) will be deleted.'=>'如果您对迁移满意，可以关闭此消息，您旧的格式选项（即此撤销选项）将被删除。','If you just want to deactivate the plugin, <a href="%s">go to your plugins page</a>.'=>'如果您只想禁用插件，<a href="%s">请前往您的插件页面</a>。','If you modify the dates where recurrences will not occur on, any recurrences falling within these dates will be %s. New recurrences will be created if you remove unavailable dates which previously blocked recurrnce dates.'=>'如果您修改不重复活动的日期，落在这些日期内的任何重复活动都将%s。如果您移除先前阻止重复日期的不可用日期，将会创建新的重复活动。','If you prefer a ticket table like with multiple tickets, even for single ticket events, enable this.'=>'如果您想要显示多票的门票表格，即使是一个单票活动，也是可以实现的。','If you select a default country, that will be pre-selected when creating a new location.'=>'如果您选择了一个默认国家，当创建一个新位置时他将被提前选择。','If you shorten the date range or limit your recurrence dates, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be %s.'=>'如果您缩短日期范围或限制重复日期，落在新日期范围之外的任何重复活动都将%s。','If you update this event data and save, it could get overwritten if you edit the repeating event template. To make it an independent, <a href="%s">detach it</a>.'=>'如果您更新此活动数据并保存，在编辑重复活动模板时它可能会被覆盖。要使其独立，请<a href="%s">分离它</a>。','If you use the %s <a href="%s">shortcode</a>, you can display a map of all your locations and events, the settings below will be used.'=>'如果你使用 %s <a href="%s">简码</a>， 你可以显示一个包括你所有位置和活动的地图，以下的设置将被使用。','If you use the <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> <a href="%s">placeholder</a> when displaying individual event and location information, the settings below will be used.'=>'如果你使用<code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code><a href="%s">占位符</a>，当显示单个活动和位置信息，以下设置将被使用。','If you want to edit general options for Events Manager, visit the main %s.'=>'如果要编辑 Events Manager 的常规选项，请访问主%s。','If you would like every event booking confirmation email sent to an administrator write their email here (leave blank to not send an email).'=>'如果你希望每个活动的报名确认都能发送给管理员，请在这里填写他们的电子邮件（留下空白不至于发送邮件）。','If you would like to add extra classes to your body html tag when a single %s page is displayed, enter it here. May be useful or necessary if your theme requires special class names for specific templates.'=>'如果您希望在显示单个 %s 页面时为 body HTML 标签添加额外的类，请在此输入。如果您的主题要求特定模板使用特殊类名，这可能很有用或必不可少。','If you would like to disable comments entirely, disable this, otherwise you can disable comments on each single %s. Note that %s with comments enabled will still be until you resave them.'=>'如果您想完全禁用评论，请禁用它，或者您可以禁用每一个 %s 的评论。请注意已禁用评论的 %s 将保持原态直到您重新保存它为止。','If you would like to download a dev version, but just as a one-off, you can force a dev version check by clicking the button below. If there is one available, it should appear in your plugin updates page as a regular update.'=>'如果你想要下载一个dev版本，但是只是一次性的，你可以点击下面的按钮强制dev版本查看。如果有一个可用的，它将作为一个定期更新出现在你的插件更新页。','If you would prefer all your locations to belong to your main blog, users in sub-sites will still be able to create locations, but the actual locations are created and reside in the main blog.'=>'如果您希望所有位置都归属于您的主博客，用户在子网站中仍然可以创建位置，但实际的位置是创建和驻留在主博客上的。','If you would prefer to hide this page, add %s to your wp-config.php file.'=>'如果您想隐藏此页面，请将 %s 添加到 wp-config.php 文件中。','If you\'re using the Google Maps, the more detail you provide, the more accurate Google can be at finding your location. If your address isn\'t being found, please <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>try it on maps.google.com</a> by adding all the fields below separated by commas.'=>'若您正在使用谷歌地图，您提供的细节越多，谷歌便能更精确地找到您提供的地址。如果您的地址没有被找到，请在 <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>maps.google.com</a>上，加上如下字段并通过逗号分开试试。','Image'=>'图像','Image Dimensions'=>'图片尺寸','Image input must be an attachment ID, URL, or object with source_url / content_base64 / file.'=>'图片输入必须是附件 ID、网址，或包含 source_url / content_base64 / file 的对象。','Import'=>'导入','Import %1$s, %2$s'=>'导入 %1$s，%2$s','Import Settings'=>'导入设置','Import a %s'=>'导入 %s','Import and Migrate'=>'导入和迁移','Import as'=>'导入为','Import as a list of dates'=>'导入为日期列表','Import events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, or copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from another events plugin. Either can be rolled back, and the original data is left untouched.'=>'从 CSV 文件导入活动、地址或组织者，或从其他活动插件复制您的活动、场地、组织者、门票和参会者。两种方式都可以回滚，原始数据不会被改动。','Import into Events Manager'=>'导入到 Events Manager','Import/Export Settings'=>'导入/导出设置','Imported, with a note'=>'已导入，附带说明','Importing rows'=>'正在导入行','Imports'=>'导入','Imports events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, one row for each. A repeating event is one row too. Run it, check the result, and roll the import back if it is not what you wanted.'=>'从 CSV 文件导入活动、地址或组织者，每项占一行。重复活动同样占一行。运行导入，检查结果，如果不是您想要的，可以回滚导入。','In order to use attributes, you must define some in your templates, otherwise they\'ll never show. Go to Events > Settings > General to add attribute placeholders.'=>'为了使用属性，你必须在你的模版中定义一些项目，否则它们将不会被显示。使用路径：活动>设置>常规 来添加属性占位符。','In single ticket mode, users can only create one ticket per event (and will not see options to add more tickets).'=>'在单一门票模式下，用户每个活动只能创建一种门票（且看不到添加更多门票的选项）。','In the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>, you\'ll find various textboxes where you can edit how event information looks, such as for event and location lists. Using the placeholders below, you can choose what information should be displayed.'=>'在<a href=\'%s\'>设置页面</a>，你将会找到各种文本框让你可以编辑活动信息的外观，例如活动和地点表。使用以下的占位符，你可以选择必须显示的信息。','In the boxes below, you are expected to write the page IDs. For multiple pages, use comma-separated values e.g. 1,2,3. Entering 0 means EVERY page, -1 means the home page.'=>'在下方的框中，请填写页面 ID。多个页面请使用逗号分隔的值，例如 1,2,3。输入 0 表示所有页面，-1 表示主页。','In this case, a user can confirm their own booking even if the booking is pending.'=>'在这种情况下，即使报名处于待审核状态，用户也可以自行确认其报名。','Include %s'=>'包含%s','Include Countries'=>'包含的国家','Include all'=>'全部包含','Include cancelled events?'=>'包含已取消的活动？','Include in WordPress Searches?'=>'包括进WordPress搜索中？','Include on'=>'包含于','Include only guest submissions'=>'仅包含访客提交','Include only these %1$s IDs, for multiple values separate by commas such as %2$s.'=>'仅包含这些%1$s ID，多个值请用逗号分隔，例如 %2$s。','Include pages where you use shortcode or PHP to display event submission forms.'=>'包含您使用简码或 PHP 显示活动提交表单的页面。','Include pages where you use shortcodes or widgets to display event search forms.'=>'包含您使用简码或小工具显示活动搜索表单的页面。','Include past events'=>'包括过去的活动','Included in %s'=>'包含在 %s 中','Included with your %s'=>'已包含在您的 %s 中','Includes hybrid events, which can also be attended physically.'=>'包括混合活动，也可以到现场参加。','Incomplete Bookings'=>'未完成的报名','Individual Components'=>'各个组件','Individual tickets with remaining spaces will not be available if total booking spaces reach this limit. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'当总预订位置达到这个极限，个别票的剩余位置将不可用。空置此项标示没有限制。','Inherit your theme settings'=>'继承主题设置','Initial lengths'=>'初始长度','Inline'=>'行内','Insert the address of the notification sender.'=>'输入通知发送者的地址','Insert the display name of the notification sender.'=>'输入通知发送者的显示名称。','Insert the password to be used to access your SMTP server'=>'输入密码访问您的SMTP服务器','Insert the username to be used to access your SMTP server.'=>'输入用户名访问您的SMTP服务器。','Install'=>'安装','Installed'=>'已安装','Installed, not active'=>'已安装，未激活','Invalid Number'=>'无效的数字','Invalid file upload.'=>'文件上传无效。','Invalid interval format for %s'=>'%s 的间隔格式无效','Invalid request'=>'无效的请求','Invalid source URL.'=>'来源网址无效。','Involid token credentials, the folloiwng are missing: %s.'=>'令牌凭据无效,缺少以下内容:%s。','Is consent required?'=>'是否必须同意？','It looks like you have WPML enabled on your site. We advise you also install our extra <a href="%s">Events Manager WPML Connector</a> plugin which helps the two work better together. <a href="%s">Dismiss message</a>'=>'您的站点似乎启用了 WPML。建议您同时安装我们的 <a href="%s">Events Manager WPML Connector</a> 扩展，以便两者更好地协同工作。<a href="%s">忽略消息</a>','JavaScript Files'=>'JavaScript 文件','Join'=>'加入','Join online'=>'在线加入','Keep The Events Calendar\'s web addresses for events, venues, organizers, categories and tags'=>'保留 The Events Calendar 的活动、场地、组织者、类别和标签网址','Keep your current settings, or individuall revert to default formats.'=>'保留您当前的设置，或单独还原为默认格式。','Kilometers'=>'公里','Label'=>'标签','Labels'=>'标签','Language Booked'=>'报名语言','Large'=>'大','Last %d Months'=>'最近 %d 个月','Last Month'=>'上月','Last Name'=>'姓','Last Year'=>'去年','Last checked via %1$s on %2$s.'=>'上次通过 %1$s 于 %2$s 检查。','Last page'=>'末页','Last sync failed: %s'=>'上次同步失败：%s','Latitude'=>'纬度','Learn More'=>'了解更多','Learn more'=>'了解更多','Leave blank for default archetype setting.'=>'留空则使用默认的存档类型设置。','Leave blank for no limit.'=>'留空表示不限制。','Leave blank to use the built-in default for your site\'s language.'=>'留空则使用适合您站点语言的内置默认值。','Leave blank to use the default format 