能包含小写字母、数字、连字符和正斜杠。','Permanently deletes an Events Manager booking.'=>'永久删除一个 Events Manager 报名。','Personal Details'=>'个人信息','Personal details have successfully been modified.'=>'个人信息已成功修改。','Phone'=>'电话号码','Phone Number'=>'电话号码','Phone Numbers'=>'电话号码','Phone number'=>'电话号码','Phone numbers can be used for further contact for both those that make bookings and submit events. We offer an advanced international-compatible phone input field with multiple options which standardize and ensure valid/consistent international phone numbers are provided by your users.'=>'电话号码可用于进一步联系报名者和提交活动者。我们提供支持国际号码的高级电话输入字段，带有多个选项，可规范并确保你的用户提供有效且一致的国际电话号码。','Physical'=>'实体','Physical Locations'=>'实体地址','Physical Spaces'=>'实体名额','Physical Venue'=>'实体场地','Pie Chart'=>'饼图','Pills'=>'胶囊','Pixelite'=>'Pixelite','Placeholders for customizing event pages'=>'定制活动页面的占位符','Placeholders: %1$s and %2$s plus the usual booking placeholders.'=>'占位符：%1$s 和 %2$s，以及常用的报名占位符。','Please <a href="%s">Log In</a> to view your bookings.'=>'请<a href="%s">登录</a>查看您的报名。','Please add a User ID.'=>'请添加用户 ID。','Please check the communications consent box so we can contact you if necessary.'=>'请勾选沟通同意框，以便我们在必要时联系您。','Please check the consent box so we can collect and store your submitted information.'=>'请勾选同意框，以便我们收集并存储您提交的信息。','Please choose a virtual platform for this event.'=>'请为此活动选择虚拟平台。','Please confirm that you wish to withdraw from the following booking. This step submits your declaration of withdrawal.'=>'请确认您要撤销以下报名。此步骤将提交您的撤销声明。','Please enter a valid URL for this event location.'=>'请为此活动地点输入有效的网址。','Please enter a valid URL.'=>'请输入有效的网址。','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'请输入有效的电子邮箱地址。','Please enter a valid phone number.'=>'请输入有效的电话号码。','Please enter a valid ticket price e.g. 10.50 (no currency signs)'=>'请输入一个有效的票价，例如：10.50（无货币符号）','Please enter dates and times for your first recurrence pattern in the recurrence section.'=>'请在重复活动部分输入第一个重复样式的日期和时间。','Please enter your Location ID, or leave blank for no location.'=>'请输入你的位置 ID，或留空表示无位置。','Please enter your Location ID.'=>'请输入你的位置 ID。','Please fill in all required fields correctly.'=>'请正确填写所有必填字段。','Please provide a dashicons class, url to a png/svg file, or leave blank for default menu icon.'=>'请提供 dashicons 类、png/svg 文件的网址，或留空使用默认菜单图标。','Please provide a valid phone number.'=>'请提供有效的电话号码。','Please provide some link text for this event location URL.'=>'请为此活动地点网址提供链接文字。','Please select a valid location.'=>'请选择有效的地点。','Please select at least one space to proceed with your booking.'=>'请至少选择一个名额以继续报名。','Please specify what days of the week this event should occur on.'=>'请指定此活动在每周的哪几天举行。','Please supply a valid email format.'=>'请提供一个有效的电子邮件格式。','Please update your network and when you\'re happy with the changes you can also finalize the migration by deleting unecessary data in the %s page.'=>'请更新您的网络，满意更改后，您还可以通过删除 %s 页面中不必要的数据来完成迁移。','Please upload a valid txt file containing Events Manager import settings.'=>'请上传包含 Events Manager 导入设置的有效 txt 文件。','Please visit the %s to see migration options.'=>'请访问%s查看迁移选项。','Please wait while the booking is being submitted.'=>'报名正在被发送，请稍等。','Plural'=>'复数','Plural version of the Custom Post Type (CPT) name, used internally.'=>'自定义文章类型（CPT）名称的复数形式，供内部使用。','Plural version of the Custom Post Type name, used internally.'=>'自定义文章类型名称的复数形式，供内部使用。','Plural version of the Type Key, used internally. For example, workshop would be workshops.'=>'类型键的复数形式，供内部使用。例如，workshop 的复数为 workshops。','Popular %s'=>'热门%s','Popular Event Categories'=>'受欢迎的活动类别','Popular Event Tags'=>'受欢迎的活动标签','Post Classes'=>'邮政类','Postcode'=>'邮政编码','Preparing'=>'准备中','Prevent unnecessary loading of JavaScript files on pages where they are not needed.'=>'避免在不需要 JavaScript 文件的页面上进行不必要的加载。','Preview Formats'=>'预览格式','Preview Start Times'=>'预览开始时间','Preview mode is enabled. Only site admins will see the difference, our new default formats will be used instead of your current formats. You can continue to edit/save this settings page without overwriting saved settings.'=>'预览模式已启用。只有站点管理员能看到差异，将使用我们新的默认格式代替您当前的格式。您可以继续编辑/保存此设置页面，而不会覆盖已保存的设置。','Previous Period'=>'上一时段','Previous Year'=>'上一年','Previous page'=>'上一页','Price'=>'价格','Pricing'=>'定价','Privacy Consent'=>'隐私同意','Privacy Policy and Consent'=>'隐私政策与同意','Pro Add-On'=>'Pro 扩展','Pro installs alongside the free Events Manager plugin. Every license includes one year of updates and Pro support.'=>'Pro 与免费版 Events Manager 插件一同安装。每个许可证都包含一年的更新和 Pro 支持。','Processing ...'=>'处理中...','Profile'=>'资料','Progress'=>'进度','Provide one of `id`, `source_url`, `content_base64`, or a multipart `file` upload.'=>'请提供 `id`、`source_url`、`content_base64` 或 multipart `file` 上传之一。','Published'=>'已发布','Published Event'=>'发布活动','Push notifications for the <a href="%s">mobile app</a>. When enabled, registered devices receive real-time pushes for bookings and events on this site, and the app exposes per-type notification preferences to the user.'=>'<a href="%s">移动应用</a>的推送通知。启用后，已注册的设备会实时收到此站点上报名和活动的推送，应用也会向用户提供按类型设置通知偏好的选项。','QR code check-in from your phone'=>'用手机扫描二维码签到','Quantity'=>'数量','RSS'=>'RSS','RSS Scope'=>'RSS范围','RSS description format'=>'RSS描述格式','RSS limit'=>'RSS极限','RSS main description'=>'RSS主要描述','RSS main title'=>'RSS主标题','RSS title format'=>'RSS标题格式','RSVP'=>'回复邀请','RSVP - %s'=>'回复邀请 - %s','RSVP Modifications'=>'回复邀请修改','RSVP Status'=>'回复邀请状态','RSVP Syncing'=>'回复邀请同步','Re-Check Updates'=>'重新查看更新内容','Re-Submitted Event Awaiting Approval'=>'重新提交的活动等待批准','Re-order.'=>'重新排序。','Read more on our blog'=>'在我们的博客上了解更多','Read our announcement'=>'阅读我们的公告','Read-only abilities for retrieving Events Manager events, locations, bookings, categories, and tags.'=>'用于获取 Events Manager 活动、地点、报名、类别和标签的只读功能。','Reason (optional)'=>'原因（可选）','Received on: %s'=>'接收时间：%s','Received: %s'=>'收到时间：%s','Recent Bookings'=>'近期报名','Recent Events Manager updates have made security improvements to how events are output, specifically with Shortcodes. The result is that some shortcode created prior to these updates will be displayed as raw/escaped HTML rather than content.'=>'Events Manager 最近的更新改进了活动输出的安全性，特别是简码方面。因此，在这些更新之前创建的部分简码可能会显示为原始/转义的 HTML，而不是内容。','Reconnect'=>'重新连接','Recurrence %s'=>'重复实例 %s','Recurrence %s cannot start after they end.'=>'重复实例%s不能晚于结束时间开始。','Recurrence Interval'=>'重复间隔','Recurrences'=>'重复活动','Recurrences last all day.'=>'重复活动持续全天。','Recurrences that currently take place within new unavailable dates will be %s'=>'目前处于新不可用日期内的重复活动将%s','Recurrences will end on:'=>'重复活动将在以下日期结束：','Recurrences will span between:'=>'重复活动的跨度为：','Recurrences will start from:'=>'重复活动将从以下日期开始：','Recurring'=>'定期','Recurring %s'=>'定期%s','Recurring Event'=>'定期活动','Recurring Events'=>'定期活动','Recurring Events Picker'=>'定期活动选择器','Recurring events (Pro)'=>'定期活动(Pro)','Recurring events allow you to create one event page with recurring dates on the same page. Recurrences have their own bookings assigned to them, but can be linked with shared tickets.'=>'定期活动允许你创建一个活动页面，并在同一页面上包含重复的日期。每个重复实例都有各自的报名，但可通过共享门票关联。','Recurring events have a picker in order to load the right booking form, choose your picker style for your booking forms.'=>'定期活动设有选择器，用于加载正确的报名表单，请为您的报名表单选择选择器样式。','Redirect any other old addresses, such as single dates of recurring events, series pages and calendar views, once The Events Calendar is deactivated'=>'停用 The Events Calendar 后，重定向其他旧网址，例如定期活动的单个日期、系列页面和日历视图','Refresh'=>'刷新','Region'=>'区域','Region:'=>'地区：','Registration Email Templates'=>'注册电子邮件模板','Registration Information'=>'注册信息','Registration email'=>'注册电子邮件','Registration email subject'=>'注册电子邮件主题','Reject'=>'拒绝','Rejected'=>'被拒绝','Rejected booking email'=>'被拒绝报名邮件','Remember Me'=>'记住我','Remember and hide checkbox'=>'记住并隐藏复选框','Remember and show checkbox'=>'记住并显示复选框','Remember filtering options'=>'记住筛选选项','Remember these settings'=>'记住这些设置','Remembering Consent'=>'记住同意','Remove'=>'删除','Remove Image'=>'删除图片','Remove Orphaned Events'=>'移除孤立活动','Remove or reorder columns below.'=>