hat fall outside new pattern will be %s'=>'落在新样式之外的重新安排的重复活动将%s','Responsive'=>'响应式','Responsive Behaviour'=>'响应式行为','Restrict to'=>'要限制','Restrict uploads to a specific type of file. Leave as "Any Type" to allow all.'=>'将上传限制为特定的文件类型。保持“任意类型”则允许所有类型。','Result'=>'结果','Results per Page'=>'每页结果数','Resume'=>'继续','Resume Previous Attempt (All Blogs)'=>'继续上次尝试（所有博客）','Retrieves Events Manager %s.'=>'获取 Events Manager %s。','Retrieves a filtered collection of Events Manager events.'=>'获取经过筛选的 Events Manager 活动集合。','Retrieves a filtered collection of Events Manager locations.'=>'获取经过筛选的 Events Manager 地点集合。','Retrieves booking availability, spaces, and ticket availability for one event.'=>'获取一个活动的报名余量、名额和门票余量。','Retrieves bookings visible to the current user.'=>'获取当前用户可见的报名。','Retrieves one Events Manager %s by ID.'=>'按 ID 获取一个 Events Manager %s。','Retrieves one Events Manager event by ID.'=>'按 ID 获取一个 Events Manager 活动。','Retrieves one Events Manager location by ID.'=>'按 ID 获取一个 Events Manager 地点。','Retrieves one Events Manager ticket by ID.'=>'按 ID 获取一张 Events Manager 门票。','Retrieves one booking by ID if visible to the current user.'=>'按 ID 获取一个报名（如果当前用户可见）。','Retrieves tickets for one Events Manager event.'=>'获取一个 Events Manager 活动的门票。','Returns countries with their ISO-3166 alpha-2 code and translated display name. By default returns the full ISO list — useful for populating a country picker. Pass `only_available: true` to narrow the result to countries that have at least one stored location row.'=>'返回国家及其 ISO-3166 alpha-2 代码和已翻译的显示名称。默认返回完整的 ISO 列表，可用于填充国家选择器。传入 `only_available: true` 可将结果缩小到至少有一条已存储地点记录的国家。','Returns the distinct list of region names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country` to narrow results to one country.'=>'返回 Events Manager 地点中存在的不重复区域名称列表。传入 `country` 可将结果缩小到某个国家。','Returns the distinct list of state/province names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country` and/or `region` to narrow results.'=>'返回 Events Manager 地点中存在的不重复州/省名称列表。传入 `country` 和/或 `region` 可缩小结果范围。','Returns the distinct list of town/city names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country`, `region`, and/or `state` to narrow results.'=>'返回 Events Manager 地点中存在的不重复城镇/城市名称列表。传入 `country`、`region` 和/或 `state` 可缩小结果范围。','Returns the exact fields, payload locations, payment options, and a ready-to-submit example payload needed to create a booking for one event. Call this before create-booking.'=>'返回为一个活动创建报名所需的确切字段、载荷位置、支付选项以及可直接提交的示例载荷。请在 create-booking 之前调用。','Revert to viewing your previously saved fromats.'=>'还原为查看您之前保存的格式。','Revoked'=>'已撤销','Right of Withdrawal (EU)'=>'撤回权（欧盟）','Rings'=>'圆环','Roll back'=>'回滚','Rollback'=>'回滚','Rolled back'=>'已回滚','Row'=>'行','Rows imported'=>'已导入的行','Rows skipped'=>'已跳过的行','Run again (sync changes)'=>'再次运行(同步更改)','Running…'=>'正在运行…','SMTP Encryption'=>'SMTP 加密','SMTP authentication is often needed. If you use Gmail, make sure to set this parameter to Yes'=>'SMTP身份验证通常是需要的。如果您使用GMail,请确保该参数设置为Yes','SMTP password'=>'SMTP密码','SMTP username'=>'SMTP用户名','Sale Averages'=>'平均销售额','Sales'=>'销售','Same as <em>Date Format</em>, but this is used for the datepickers used by Events Manager.'=>'与<em>日期格式</em>相同，但用于 Events Manager 使用的日期选择器。','Same concept as the body classes option, but some themes also use the <code>post_class()</code> function within page content to differentiate styling between post types.'=>'与体类选项概念相同，但某些主题还会在页面内容中使用 <code>post_class()</code> 函数，以区分不同文章类型的样式。','Sanitize shortcode content?'=>'净化简码内容？','Save'=>'保存','Save %d%%'=>'节省 %d%%','Save Changes'=>'保存更改','Save Settings'=>'保存设置','Save Ticket'=>'保存门票','Save imported events and locations as'=>'将导入的活动和地址保存为','Save your settings for this to take effect!'=>'请保存设置使其生效！','Saved, but the featured image could not be attached: %s. To fix it: call upload-media (use content_base64 if the source blocks server-side fetches, e.g. Unsplash), then either pass featured_image_for_event/featured_image_for_location on that same upload-media call, or pass the returned attachment id as featured_image to update-event / update-location.'=>'已保存，但无法附加特色图片：%s。修复方法：调用 upload-media（如果来源阻止服务器端抓取，例如 Unsplash，请使用 content_base64），然后在同一次 upload-media 调用中传入 featured_image_for_event/featured_image_for_location，或将返回的附件 ID 作为 featured_image 传给 update-event / update-location。','Scope'=>'范围','Scope of the locations'=>'位置的范围','Search'=>'搜索','Search %s'=>'搜索 %s','Search %s...'=>'搜索 %s 中...','Search Event Categories'=>'搜索活动类别','Search Event Tags'=>'搜索活动标签','Search Events'=>'搜索活动','Search Filter Label'=>'搜索过滤器标签','Search Form'=>'搜索表单','Search Forms'=>'搜索表单','Search Locations'=>'搜索位置','Search Repeating Events'=>'搜索重复活动','Search Results View Type'=>'搜索结果视图类型','Search bookings'=>'搜索报名','Search button text'=>'发送按钮的文本','Search form will be pre-selected with this country.'=>'搜索表单将预先选中此国家。','Search forms'=>'搜索表单','Searching...'=>'搜索中...','See All'=>'查看全部','See original translation.'=>'查看原始翻译。','Select Location'=>'选择地点','Select a Timezone to reset all your blog events to.'=>'选择一个时区，用于重置您所有博客的活动。','Select a blog and click the button next to it to clean up that specific blog. You must clean up one blog at a time.'=>'选择一个博客并点击其旁边的按钮即可清理该博客。您必须一次清理一个博客。','Select a blog...'=>'选择博客...','Select a date'=>'选择日期','Select a group you admin to attach this event to it. Note that all other admins of that group can modify the booking.'=>'选择您管理的群组以将此活动关联到该群组。请注意，该群组的所有其他管理员都可以修改此报名。','Select a time'=>'选择时间','Select date range'=>'选择日期范围','Select dates'=>'选择日期','Select number of spaces'=>'选择名额数量','Select the booking you wish to withdraw from.'=>'请选择您要撤销的报名。','Select the editor type you\'d like to use for submitting content in your dashboard.'=>'选择在仪表盘中提交内容时使用的编辑器类型。','Select the method to send email notification.'=>'选择发送邮件通知的方式','Select the options below and export all the records you have currently filtered (all pages) into a spreadsheet format.'=>'选择以下选项，并将您当前筛选的所有记录（所有页面）导出为电子表格格式。','Select the view types a user can select to display on the default search form, you can override this selection using the %s argument in shortcodes and PHP functions.'=>'选择用户可在默认搜索表单上选用的视图类型，你可以在简码和 PHP 函数中使用 %s 参数覆盖此选择。','Select which archetypes this site will use and choose a default type.'=>'选择此站点将使用哪些原型，并选择一个默认类型。','Select yes to allow bookings and tickets for events.'=>'选择 是 可预定和购买活动门票','Select yes to disable Events Manager from enabling thumbnails (some themes may already have this enabled, which we cannot be turned off here).'=>'选择yes让活动管理器禁止使用缩略图（某些主题可能已经禁止，我们无法在这里关闭）。','Select yes to enable the attributes feature'=>'选择 是 和启动熟性功能','Select yes to enable the category features'=>'选择 是 和启动分类功能','Select yes to enable the tag features'=>'选择yes来启用tag功能','Select yes to select location from a drop-down menu; location selection will be faster, but you will lose the ability to insert locations with events'=>'选择“是”将通过下拉菜单选择位置；选择位置会更快，但你将无法随活动一起插入位置','Sell event tickets through your WooCommerce cart and checkout, with bookings kept in sync with orders, and take payment with any gateway WooCommerce supports. Sold separately on Woo.com and not included in Pro Plus.'=>'通过 WooCommerce 购物车和结账销售活动门票，报名与订单保持同步，并可使用 WooCommerce 支持的任何网关收款。在 Woo.com 单独销售，不包含在 Pro Plus 中。','Send Email'=>'发送电子邮件','Send HTML Emails?'=>'发送HTML电子邮件？','Send cancelled booking email?'=>'发送报名取消电子邮件？','Sends a general email to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled, which is customized in your %s setings.'=>'向已取消活动的所有已确认和待审核的报名发送一封通用电子邮件，该邮件可在你的%s设置中自定义。','Sent to the consumer as the legally-required acknowledgment of receipt. It records the withdrawal statement and the exact date and time of receipt, and confirms receipt only — not the validity of the withdrawal.'=>'作为法律要求的收悉确认发送给消费者。它记录撤回声明以及收悉的确切日期和时间，仅确认收悉，不确认撤回是否有效。','Separate %s with commas'=>'用逗号分隔%s','Separate Range Inputs?'=>'分开的范围输入？','Separate event categories with commas'=>'用逗号分隔活动类别','Separate event tags with commas'=>'用逗号分隔活动标签','Series pass, paid with booking #%d'=>'系列通票,通过报名 #%d 付款','Server API Credentials'=>'服务器 API 凭据','Set booking status'=>'设置报名状态','Setting this to no will allow you to submit events without locations. You can use the <code>{no_location}...{/no_location}</code> or <code>{has_location}..{/has_location}</code> conditional placeholder to selectively display location information.'=>'设置此项为“no”允许你在无地点的情况下发送这个活动。你可以使用<code>{no_location}…{/no_location}</code> or <code>{has_location}..{/has_location}</code> 有条件的占位符来选择性的显示地点信息。','Setting this to yes will also make your images crop efficiently with the %s feature in the %s plugin.'=>'将此项设置为是，还可以让您的图片通过 %s 插件中的 %s 功能高效裁剪。','Setting this to yes will make all events save in the main site event tables (EM must also be activated). This allows you to share events across different blogs, such as showing events in your network whilst allowing users to display and manage their events within their own blog. Bear in mind that activating this will mean old events created on the sub-blogs will not be accessible anymore, and if you switch back they will be but new events created during global events mode will only remain on the main site.'=>'设置这个并确认将会将所有活动保存在主站点的活动表格中（EM也必须被激活）。这将允许您通过不同的博客分享此项活动，例如：在网络中显示您的活动，同时允许其他用户在自己的博客中展示和管理他们的活动。请牢记，激活它意味着在博客附页中的已被创建的就旧活动将不再可用，如果您转转换回来他们还是在的，但在全球表格模式中新创建的活动将只保留在主站点上。','Setting this to yes will make categories display as a page rather than an archive.'=>'做如此设置并确认后将使类别作为页面显示而不是作为一份文档。','Settings'=>'设置','Settings > Emails'=>'设置 > 电子邮件','Settings Page'=>'设置页面','Settings have been reset back to default. Your events, locations and categories have not been modified.'=>'设置被重置为默认。您的活动，位置和类别并没有被修改。','Settings imported.'=>'设置已导入。','Shortcode HTML Entity Decoding'=>'简码 HTML 实体解码','Shortcodes and blocks'=>'短代码和区块','Shorten the calendar headings containing the days of the week, use 0 for the full name.'=>'缩短包含星期中的日期的日历的标题长度，使用0作为全名。','Show'=>'显示','Show "all events" link at bottom'=>'在底部显示“所有活动”链接','Show Advanced Options'=>'显示高级选项','Show Advanced Search'=>'显示高级搜索','Show Flags'=>'显示旗帜','Show Long Events?'=>'显示长期活动？','Show Search'=>'显示搜索','Show Selected Dialcode'=>'显示所选区号','Show all events link at bottom?'=>'是否在底部显示所有活动链接？','Show categories?'=>'显示类别？','Show countries?'=>'显示国家？','Show date range?'=>'显示日期范围？','Show dates in timeslots?'=>'在时段中显示日期？','Show distance options?'=>'显示距离选项？','Show events search?'=>'显示活动搜索？','Show footer link?'=>'显示页脚链接？','Show form again?'=>'再次显示表单？','Show fully booked timeslots?'=>'显示已满额的时间段？','Show geolocation search?'=>'显示地理位置搜索？','Show hide/show trigger?'=>'显示隐藏/显示触发器？','Show label'=>'显示标签','Show list on day with single event?'=>'显示只有一项活动的日期清单','Show locations search?'=>'显示地点搜索？','Show long events'=>'显示长期活动','Show main search bar?'=>'显示主搜索栏？','Show member-only tickets?'=>'显示仅限会员的门票？','Show multiple tickets if logged out?'=>'在注销后显示多张门票？','Show number of locations'=>'显示该位置数量','Show regions?'=>'显示地区？','Show search filters on page load'=>'页面加载时显示搜索过滤器','Show some love?'=>'展示一些爱心？','Show sorting icon?'=>'显示排序图标？','Show spaces left?'=>'显示剩余名额？','Show states?'=>'显示州？','Show tags?'=>'显示标签？','Show text search?'=>'显示文本搜索？','Show the flag of the selected country code and in the country selection list of the phone input field.'=>'在电话输入字段中显示所选国家代码的旗帜，并在国家选择列表中显示旗帜。','Show the join link publicly, for example on the event page and in calendar feeds'=>'公开显示加入链接，例如显示在活动页面和日历订阅源中','Show the sorting icon to change the ordering of search results.'=>'显示用于更改搜索结果排序的排序图标。','Show ticket table in single ticket mode?'=>'在单票模式中显示门票表格？','Show towns/cities?'=>'显示城镇/城市？','Show unavailable tickets?'=>'显示不可用门票？','Show upcoming timeslots on the initial booking form load before a visitor chooses a calendar date.'=>'在访客选择日历日期之前，报名表单初次加载时显示即将开始的时段。','Show upcoming timeslots?'=>'显示即将开始的时段？','Show virtual events filter?'=>'显示虚拟活动过滤器？','Show/Hide Filters'=>'显示/隐藏过滤器','Shown in place of the link until then. %s is replaced with the number of minutes.'=>'在此之前显示以代替链接。%s 会被替换为分钟数。','Shows events, posts or other post types in an AJAX month, week or day calendar that visitors can filter by category or tag. Events Manager integrates with it automatically.'=>'在 AJAX 月、周或日日历中显示活动、文章或其他文章类型，访客可按类别或标签进行过滤。Events Manager 会自动与其集成。','Sign In'=>'登录','Sign Up'=>'注册','Similar to label but used in instances when referring to one single %s type.'=>'与标签类似，但用于指代单个 %s 类型的情况。','Since the event is recurring, you must specify an event end date greater than the start date.'=>'由于该活动为定期活动，您必须指定晚于开始日期的活动结束日期。','Single'=>'单数','Single %s Format'=>'单%s 格式','Single %s Page'=>'每个 %s 页面','Single %s page format'=>'每个 %s 页面的格式','Single %s title format'=>'每个 %s 的标题的格式','Single Location/Event Map Format'=>'单项地址／活动地图格式','Single dot'=>'单个圆点','Single ticket mode?'=>'单票模式？','Site Categories'=>'站点类别','Site admins will be allowed to rename the base event and location %s on their individual sites.'=>'站点管理员将可以在各自站点上重命名基础活动和地点的%s。','Skip rows already on this site: events with the same name and start, locations with the same name'=>'跳过此站点上已有的行：名称和开始时间相同的活动、名称相同的地址','Skip the row'=>'跳过该行','Skipped'=>'已跳过','Slug'=>'Slug','Slugs'=>'别名','Small'=>'小','Small Calendar'=>'小日历','Sold Out'=>'售罄','Some WordPress themes don\'t follow best practices when generating navigation menus, and so the automatic title rewriting feature may cause problems, if your menus aren\'t working correctly on the event pages, try setting this to \'Yes\', and provide an appropriate HTML title format below.'=>'某些WordPress当生成导航目录时不遵循最佳的做法，所以自动标题重写功能可能会产生问题，如果在活动页面上你的菜单不能正常工作，尝试设置它到“Yes”，然后在下面提供一个适当的HTML标题格式。','Something went wrong saving your %s to the index table. Please inform a site administrator about this.'=>'在将您的 %s 保存至主页表格中时出现了些问题。请将此事通知网络管理员。','Something went wrong with the recurrence update...'=>'在定期活动报名更新中出现了问题...','Sorting'=>'排序','Sorting Order'=>'排序方式','Spaces'=>'出席人数','Spaces confirmed'=>'确认的席位','Split by timeslots?'=>'按时段拆分？','Spreadsheet'=>'电子表格','Stack By'=>'堆叠依据','Stacked metaboxes'=>'堆叠式元框','Standard'=>'标准','Standard Ticket'=>'标准门票','Start'=>'开始','Start Date'=>'开始日期','Start Time'=>'开始时间','Start comparison date'=>'对比开始日期','Start date'=>'开始日期','Start import'=>'开始导入','Start migration'=>'开始迁移','Start time'=>'开始时间','Start time is required.'=>'开始时间是必须填写的。','Start/End'=>'开始/结束','Started'=>'已开始','State'=>'状态','State or province'=>'州或省','State/County'=>'州/县','State/County:'=>'州/县:','Statistic Averages/Totals'=>'统计平均值/总计','Status'=>'状态','Status reason'=>'状态原因','Status: %s'=>'状态：%s','Stay updated with the latest features, tips, and news about Events Manager by subscribing to our newsletter!'=>'订阅我们的新闻通讯，及时了解 Events Manager 的最新功能、技巧和新闻！','Stay updated with the latest features, tips, and news about Events Manager!'=>'及时了解 Events Manager 的最新功能、技巧和新闻！','Step 1 button'=>'第 1 步按钮','Stopped on an error'=>'因错误而停止','Styling Options'=>'样式选项','Sub Total'=>'小计','Submit %s'=>'提交 %s','Submit Booking'=>'提交报名','Submit Changes'=>'发送改变','Submit button text'=>'发送按钮的文档','Submit button text (payment)'=>'提交按钮文本（支付）','Submit button text (processing)'=>'提交按钮文本（处理中）','Submitted Event Awaiting Approval'=>'已发送但待批准的活动','Subscribe'=>'订阅','Subscribe Now'=>'立即订阅','Subscribe to Our Newsletter'=>'订阅我们的新闻通讯','Subscribe to our newsletter to receive exclusive content, early access to new features, and helpful event management tips directly to your inbox.'=>'订阅我们的新闻通讯，即可将独家内容、新功能抢先体验以及实用的活动管理技巧直接发送到您的邮箱。','Subsite Archetype Mode'=>'子站点原型模式','Subsites choose from network list'=>'子站点从网络列表中选择','Subtotals will exclude taxes and display taxes separately.'=>'小计将不含税费，税费单独显示。','Success Message'=>'成功发送的邮件','Successful booking'=>'成功报名','Successful pending booking'=>'成功下单','Successfully Updated Message'=>'更新成功消息','Successfully deleted all timeranges.'=>'已成功删除所有时间范围。','Successfully saved %d timeranges.'=>'已成功保存 %d 个时间范围。','Successfully saved %s'=>'成功保存 %s','Successfully updated %s'=>'已成功更新%s','Super Advanced Mode'=>'超级高级模式','Surcharges (After Taxes)'=>'附加费（税后）','Surcharges Before Taxes'=>'税前附加费','Tabbed metaboxes'=>'选项卡式元框','Tag'=>'标签','Tag Related Placeholders'=>'标签相关占位符','Tag pages'=>'标签页面','Tags'=>'标签','Tags dropdown label'=>'标签下拉菜单标签','Tags list page'=>'标签列表页面','Take bookings and payments on your own site, through your own payment gateway account, with no commission taken.'=>'在您自己的站点上通过您自己的支付网关账户处理报名和付款，不收取任何佣金。','Tax'=>'税收','Tax Rate'=>'税率','Taxes'=>'税','Taxes included'=>'含税','Taxonomy not found.'=>'未找到分类法。','Term could not be deleted.'=>'无法删除项。','Term name is required.'=>'项名称为必填项。','Term not found.'=>'未找到项。','Test Email Settings'=>'测试电子邮箱设置','Text shown in place of the link until then'=>'在此之前显示以代替链接的文字','Text with link to calendar day page with all events for that day if there are more events than the limit above, leave blank for no link as the day number is also a link.'=>'短信链接月历的日页，包括当天的全部活动，如果有比以上限量还要更多活动。如果没有链接空置此项，因为日期也是一个链接。','That is not a CSV file. In your spreadsheet program, save or export the sheet as CSV first.'=>'这不是 CSV 文件。请先在电子表格程序中将工作表另存或导出为 CSV。','That was tried a moment ago. Please wait a minute and try again.'=>'刚刚已尝试过此操作。请等待一分钟后重试。','The %s account that hosts this event is no longer connected. Reconnect it or choose another account for the event.'=>'主办此活动的 %s 账户已不再连接。请重新连接，或为该活动选择其他账户。','The Events Calendar is still active. It doesn\'t need to be: Events Manager reads its data directly, so you can deactivate it and its add-ons first. Once migrated, Events Manager uses the same web addresses, so the two plugins compete for them until The Events Calendar is deactivated. Your Events Calendar data is not changed either way.'=>'The Events Calendar 仍处于激活状态。其实不必如此：Events Manager 直接读取其数据，因此您可以先停用它及其附加组件。迁移后，Events Manager 使用相同的网址，因此在停用 The Events Calendar 之前，这两个插件会争用这些网址。无论哪种情况，您的 Events Calendar 数据都不会被更改。','The SMTP host. Usually it corresponds to \'localhost\'. If you use Gmail, set this value to \'tls://smtp.gmail.com:587\'.'=>'SMTP 主机。通常对应“localhost”。如果您使用 Gmail，请将此值设置为“tls://smtp.gmail.com:587”。','The add-on list can be refreshed once a day. Please try again tomorrow.'=>'附加组件列表每天只能刷新一次。请明天再试。','The advanced search can be styled in a section-based format, with expandable sections, or directly inline with static headings. If you want headings for some sections and not others, choose Headings and leave specific section heading labels blank in settings further down.'=>'高级搜索可以采用分节样式（带可展开的章节），也可以直接内联并带有固定标题。如果希望部分章节有标题而其他章节没有，请选择“标题”，并在下方设置中将特定章节的标题标签留空。','The bundled OAuth library is not loaded, so the AI / MCP setup screen is unavailable.'=>'未加载内置的 OAuth 库，因此 AI / MCP 设置界面不可用。','The calendar headings uses abbreviated weekdays'=>'这个日历的标题使用简写的星期日期','The country'=>'国家','The country "%s" is not recognized and was left empty.'=>'无法识别国家“%s”，已留空。','The date "%s" in the list of dates is not understood.'=>'无法识别日期列表中的日期“%s”。','The day of the month "%s" is not understood. Use 1 to 31, or last.'=>'无法识别每月的日期“%s”。请使用 1 至 31，或 last。','The default minimum width, in pixels, that each grid item can shrink to fit on one line.'=>'每个网格项在保持单行显示时可缩小到的默认最小宽度（以像素为单位）。','The default value is blank so that the booking submission button appears just below the %s section.'=>'默认值为空，因此报名提交按钮会显示在 %s 部分的正下方。','The description of the event that will appear in the calendar.'=>'将显示在日历中的活动描述。','The email "%s" is not an email address and was left out.'=>'“%s”不是邮箱地址，已被忽略。','The end date "%s" is not understood.'=>'无法识别结束日期“%s”。','The end is before the start.'=>'结束时间早于开始时间。','The end time "%s" is not understood.'=>'无法识别结束时间“%s”。','The event name. Example: Birthday party'=>'活动名称 例子：生日派对','The featured image was left out: %s'=>'精选图像已被忽略：%s','The file content does not match its file extension.'=>'文件内容与其文件扩展名不匹配。','The file could not be read.'=>'无法读取该文件。','The file did not upload. Choose a CSV file and try again.'=>'文件未上传。请选择 CSV 文件后重试。','The file does not appear to be a valid Microsoft Office document.'=>'该文件似乎不是有效的 Microsoft Office 文档。','The file does not appear to be a valid PDF.'=>'该文件似乎不是有效的 PDF。','The file has no column named "%s".'=>'文件中没有名为“%s”的列。','The file is empty.'=>'文件为空。','The file is too big! Maximum allowed size: '=>'文件太大！允许的最大大小： ','The file needs a first row of column names and at least one row below it.'=>'文件需要有一行列名作为第一行，其下至少还有一行数据。','The first row holds the column names. On the next screen you match each column to a field and see how the first rows will import, before anything is saved. A file made for the CSV importer of The Events Calendar works as it is.'=>'第一行是列名。在下一个界面中，您可以将每一列匹配到一个字段，并在保存任何内容之前查看前几行的导入效果。为 The Events Calendar 的 CSV 导入器制作的文件可直接使用。','The following blog timezones could not be successfully reset:'=>'以下博客的时区无法成功重置：','The following booking is %s :'=>'以下报名%s：','The following options will re-enable this behaviour. If you notice escaped content (raw HTML) displayed on your site, you can enable these temporarily whilst you fix the underlying issue.'=>'以下选项将重新启用之前的行为。如果您发现站点上显示了转义内容（原始 HTML），可以在修复根本问题期间临时启用这些选项。','The format of a single %s in a list.'=>'在列表中每个 %s 的格式。','The format of a single %s page title.'=>'在列表中每个 %s 页面标题。','The format of a single %s page.'=>'在列表中每个 %s 页面。','The format of a single category page title.'=>'每个类别页面标题的格式。','The format of a single tag page title.'=>'单个标签页面主题的格式','The format of any events in a list.'=>'在列表中的任意一项活动的格式。','The format of each event when displayed in the full calendar.'=>'活动在完整日历中显示时的格式。','The format of the description of each item in the events RSS feed.'=>'活动RSS订阅中每个项目的描述的格式。','The format of the events the list inserted in the category page through the %s element.'=>'通过 %s 元素插入到分类页面中的活动列表的格式。','The format of the events the list inserted in the location page through the %s element.'=>'通过 %s 元素插入到位置页面中的活动列表的格式。','The format of the events the list inserted in the tag page through the <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> element.'=>'表格插入在标签页使用 <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>，<code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> 和<code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> 元素的活动的格式。','The format of the month/year header of the calendar.'=>'日历月份/年份标题的格式。','The format of the next upcoming event in this %s.'=>'此 %s 中下一个即将举行的活动的格式。','The format of the text appearing in the balloon describing the location.'=>'在单个位置地图上形容位置的标示中显示的字体的格式。','The format of the title of each item in the events RSS feed.'=>'活动RSS订阅中每个项目的标题的格式。','The format used to display %s content on single pages or elsewhere on your site.'=>'用于在单独页面或站点其他位置显示 %s 内容的格式。','The image is too big! Maximum allowed dimensions: '=>'图像太大！允许的最大尺寸： ','The image is too small! Minimum allowed dimensions: '=>'图像太小！允许的最小尺寸： ','The image uploaded successfully but was not set as a featured image: %s The attachment ID is in this response — pass it to update-event/update-location `featured_image` once the target is editable.'=>'图片已成功上传，但未被设为特色图片：%s 附件 ID 包含在此响应中，待目标可编辑后，请将其传给 update-event/update-location 的 `featured_image`。','The input field is an example of our phone number input field. Play with the settings below and the it will update automatically to show you a preview.'=>'该输入字段是我们电话号码输入字段的示例。调整下方的设置，它会自动更新以向你展示预览。','The language used to make this booking was %s'=>'此报名所使用的语言是 %s','The largest share of an event\'s spaces, as a percentage, that all visitors\' holds together can take at once, so nobody can hold a whole event. Once it is reached, visitors can still book the remaining spaces but they are not held for them. Enter 100 for no limit.'=>'所有访客的保留合计可同时占用的活动名额的最大百分比，以防有人保留整个活动。达到上限后，访客仍可报名剩余名额，但不会为其保留。输入 100 表示不限制。','The last date the event can fall on.'=>'活动可能出现的最后一个日期。','The latitude and longitude are not a pair of coordinates and were left out.'=>'纬度和经度不是一对有效的坐标，已被忽略。','The link will be shown %s minutes before the event starts.'=>'链接将在活动开始前 %s 分钟显示。','The location "%1$s" could not be created: %2$s'=>'无法创建地址“%1$s”：%2$s','The location "%s" was not on this site, so it was created with its name only. Add its address, or import a locations file first.'=>'此站点上没有地址“%s”，因此仅以名称创建了它。请添加其地址，或先导入地址文件。','The location address'=>'该位置地址','The location information that will appear in the calendar.'=>'将显示在日历中的位置信息。','The location town'=>'该位置所在城区','The main description of your RSS events feed.'=>'您的RSS活动提要的主要描述。','The main title of your RSS events feed.'=>'您的RSS活动提要的主标题','The maximum allowed size for images uploaded, in bytes'=>'上传图像的最大允许尺寸，以字节为单位','The maximum height an uploaded image can have. Larger images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'上传图片允许的最大高度。更大的图片将被拒绝。留空表示不限制尺寸。','The maximum number of files a user can upload at once. Leave blank for unlimited.'=>'用户一次最多可上传的文件数量。留空表示不限制。','The maximum size in bytes per uploaded file.'=>'每个上传文件的最大字节数。','The maximum width an uploaded image can have. Larger images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'上传图片允许的最大宽度。更大的图片将被拒绝。留空表示不限制尺寸。','The message displayed when no %s are available.'=>'当无 %s 可用时将显示这条信息。','The message displayed when no events are available.'=>'当没有可参加的活动时这条信息将会显示。','The message to be displayed in the list generated by %s when no events are available.'=>'没有可用活动时，%s 生成的列表中显示的消息。','The message to be displayed in the list generated by <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> when no events are available.'=>'<code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> 生成的表上显示的信息，当无活动可行的时候。','The minimum height an uploaded image can have. Smaller images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'上传图片允许的最小高度。更小的图片将被拒绝。留空表示不限制尺寸。','The minimum width an uploaded image can have. Smaller images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'上传图片允许的最小宽度。更小的图片将被拒绝。留空表示不限制尺寸。','The name is empty.'=>'名称为空。','The name of the location'=>'位置名称','The number of times to repeat, "%s", is not a whole number of 1 or more.'=>'重复次数“%s”不是大于或等于 1 的整数。','The numerical units shown to those searching by distance. Use comma-separated numbers, such as "25,50,100".'=>'向按距离搜索的用户显示的数值单位。请使用逗号分隔的数字，例如“25,50,100”。','The option below allows you to disable user accounts, yet you will still see the supplied personal information for each booking.'=>'下方选项允许你停用用户账户，但你仍然可以看到每个报名所提供的个人信息。','The options below are applied to the %s placeholders.'=>'下面的选项适用于 %s 占位符。','The page containing the %s shortcode. Create a page with that shortcode and select it here.'=>'包含 %s 简码的页面。请创建一个包含该简码的页面，并在此处选择。','The port through which you e-mail notifications will be sent. Make sure the firewall doesn\'t block this port'=>'您的电子邮件通知发送通过的端口。请确保防火墙不会阻止这个端口。','The provider rate limit was reached, so this will be retried shortly.'=>'已达到服务提供方的速率限制，稍后将重试。','The repeat rule and the extra dates were combined into a list of %d dates.'=>'重复规则和额外日期已合并为包含 %d 个日期的列表。','The repeat rule gives more than %d dates.'=>'重复规则生成的日期超过 %d 个。','The repeat rule gives no dates between the start date and the repeat-until date, so the event has no dates yet.'=>'重复规则在开始日期和重复截止日期之间没有生成任何日期，因此该活动暂时没有日期。','The repeat rule gives no dates between the start date and the repeat-until date.'=>'重复规则在开始日期和重复截止日期之间没有生成任何日期。','The repeat-until date "%s" is not understood.'=>'无法识别重复截止日期“%s”。','The repeat-until date is before the start date.'=>'重复截止日期早于开始日期。','The repeating event has been converted into a recurring event.'=>'重复活动已转换为定期活动。','The repeating events have been converted into recurring events.'=>'重复活动已转换为定期活动。','The right-of-withdrawal feature is currently disabled in Events Manager settings.'=>'Events Manager 设置中当前已禁用撤回权功能。','The selected country code will also show the dialcode, such as +1 for the US.'=>'所选国家代码也将显示区号，例如美国为 +1。','The selected country will be chosen by default if auto-detect is disabled, additionally any numbers submitted whilst Phone Numbers were disabled will be considered as belonging to this country and reformatted accordingly when used for communication or display purposes.'=>'如果停用自动检测，将默认选中所选国家；此外，在电话号码功能停用期间提交的任何号码都将被视为属于该国家，并在用于通信或显示时相应地重新格式化。','The setting above is new, due to our new calendar display options. Your previous format was %s'=>'由于新增了日历显示选项，上方的设置是新增的。你之前的格式为 %s','The settings below are used when using the %s placeholder'=>'使用 %s 占位符时将采用以下设置','The start date "%s" is not understood.'=>'无法识别开始日期“%s”。','The start date is empty.'=>'开始日期为空。','The start time "%s" is not understood.'=>'无法识别开始时间“%s”。','The statutory cooling-off period is 14 days. Late submissions are still accepted and flagged for your review rather than silently rejected.'=>'法定冷静期为 14 天。逾期提交的申请仍会被接收并标记以供您审核，而不会被直接拒绝。','The text shown when a booking is being submitted, %s will be replaced by the total amount due.'=>'报名正在提交时显示的文本，%s 将被替换为应付总额。','The text shown when a booking is not free, %s will be replaced by the total amount due.'=>'报名需付费时显示的文本，%s 将被替换为应付总额。','The text used by the submit button. To use an image instead, enter the full url starting with %s or %s.'=>'发送按钮使用的文字。用图像替代，以%s 或者 %s为开头输入完整的url。','The ticket %s is no longer available.'=>'门票 %s 已不可用。','The time zone "%s" is not recognized. Use a name such as America/New_York or an offset such as UTC+2.'=>'无法识别时区“%s”。请使用 America/New_York 这样的名称，或 UTC+2 这样的偏移量。','The tip text that is shown for the advanced search trigger.'=>'高级搜索触发器显示的提示文字。','The title that will appear in the calendar.'=>'在日历中将会显示的标题','The unique name (singular) used to identify %s in the database. Use lowercase alphanumeric characters, dashes and underscores only.'=>'用于在数据库中标识 %s 的唯一名称（单数）。仅可使用小写字母、数字、连字符和下划线。','The uploaded file is no longer on the server. Upload it again.'=>'上传的文件已不在服务器上。请重新上传。','The uploads folder is not writable.'=>'上传文件夹不可写。','The virtual location for this event is not ready yet. Please try again shortly.'=>'此活动的虚拟地址尚未就绪。请稍后重试。','The website "%s" is not a web address and was left out.'=>'“%s”不是网址，已被忽略。','The week of the month "%s" is not understood. Use first, second, third, fourth or last.'=>'无法识别每月的第几周“%s”。请使用 first、second、third、fourth 或 last。','The weekday "%s" is not understood.'=>'无法识别星期几“%s”。','Theme Templates'=>'主题模板','There are not enough physical spaces left for this booking.'=>'剩余的实体名额不足以满足此次报名。','There are not enough virtual spaces left for this booking.'=>'剩余的虚拟名额不足以满足此次报名。','There is a newer version of Events Manager Pro which is recommended for this current version of Events Manager as new features have been added. Please go to the plugin website and download the latest update.'=>'当前的活动管理器需要更新的版本的专业活动管理器，因为已经添加新的功能。请到插件网站下载最近的更新。','There was a problem adding custom fields to your recurring events.'=>'向您的定期活动添加自定义字段时出现问题。','There was a problem adding tickets to your recurrences.'=>'向您的重复实例添加门票时出现问题。','There was a problem creating a user account, please contact a website administrator.'=>'在创建用户账户时出现了一个问题，请联系网络管理员。','There was a problem deleting bookings for the event.'=>'删除该活动的报名时出现问题。','There was a problem deleting the timerange.'=>'删除时间范围时出现问题。','There was a problem saving the booking.'=>'在保存报名中出现一个问题。','There was a problem saving the event timeslots to the database. Please contact an administrator if the issue persists.'=>'将活动时间段保存到数据库时出现问题。如果问题仍然存在，请联系管理员。','There was a problem saving the recurring events.'=>'在保存定期活动中出现了问题。','There was a problem saving the ticket booking.'=>'在保存票务订购中出现一个问题','There was a problem saving the ticket.'=>'在保存门票中遇到了一个问题','There was a problem saving the timerange.'=>'保存时间范围时出现问题。','There was a problem updating tickets to your recurrences.'=>'更新您的重复实例的门票时出现问题。','There was an error connecting to %s: %s'=>'连接到%s时出错：%s','There was an error upgrading your site, please try again or contact support.'=>'升级站点时出错，请重试或联系支持人员。','There was an error uploading the image.'=>'上传图像时出错。','There was an error whilst migrating your times to our new timezone-aware formats. Below is a list of errors:'=>'将您的时间迁移到新的时区感知格式时出错。以下是错误列表：','There were some errors saving your location.'=>'在保存您的位置时出现了些问题。','There were some issues whilst disconnecting from your %s account(s) :'=>'断开与您的 %s 账户的连接时出现了一些问题:','These can be overridden when using shortcode or template tags.'=>'当使用短代码或者模版标签时这些可以被覆盖。','These countries will be excluded from the country selection list.'=>'这些国家将从国家选择列表中排除。','These formats can be used on %s pages or on other areas of your site displaying an %s.'=>'这些格式可用于 %s 页面，或站点上其他显示 %s 的区域。','These formats can be used when WordPress automatically displays %s excerpts on your site and %s is enabled in your %s settings tab.'=>'当 WordPress 在你的站点上自动显示 %s 摘要且 %s 已在 %s 设置选项卡中启用时，可使用这些格式。','These formats will be used on your events page. This will also be used if you do not provide specified formats in other event lists, like in shortcodes.'=>'这些格式将被使用在你的活动页面。像在简码中，这个将同时被','These headings appear above sections of the booking form. Leave blank for no heading.'=>'这些标题显示在报名表单各部分上方。留空则不显示标题。','These options are the defaults applied to lists being showing in Grouped List view mode and can be overriden in individual lists using shortcodes, blocks, widgets etc.'=>'这些选项是应用于分组列表视图模式下列表的默认设置，可通过简码、区块、小工具等在单个列表中覆盖。','These options have security implications and are intended for transition! For more information, please see our %s.'=>'这些选项涉及安全问题，仅用于过渡！更多信息请参阅我们的%s。','These pages allow you to provide an event management interface outside the admin area on whatever page you want on your website. Bear in mind that this is overridden by BuddyPress if activated.'=>'这些页面允许您在该网站上的任何页面的管理区域外创建一个活动管理界面。请牢记一旦被保存他将被BuddyPress覆盖。','These spaces cannot be held for you right now, but you can still book them while they are available.'=>'目前无法为您保留这些名额，但在名额有余量时您仍可报名。','This %s has timeslots, you are viewing'=>'此 %s 有多个时间段，您正在查看','This %s was submitted by a guest. You will find their details in the <em>Anonymous Submitter Info</em> box'=>'此%s由访客提交。您可以在<em>匿名发布者信息</em>框中找到其详细信息','This CPT name is already used by an existing WordPress post type. Please choose another name.'=>'此 CPT 名称已被现有的 WordPress 文章类型使用。请选择其他名称。','This Month'=>'本月','This Year'=>'今年','This accepts %s and %s placeholders.'=>'接受%s和%s占位符。','This accepts %s placeholders.'=>'接受%s占位符。','This accepts %s, %s and %s placeholders.'=>'接受%s, %s 和%s 占位符。','This action aill be applied to every attendee belonging to the selected %s. Do you want to continue?'=>'此操作将应用于所选%s下的每位参会者。是否继续？','This action will be applied to the entire booking the %s belongs to. Do you want to continue?'=>'此操作将应用于该%s所属的整个报名。是否继续？','This action will be applied to the entire booking the selected %s belong to. Do you want to continue?'=>'此操作将应用于所选%s所属的整个报名。是否继续？','This booking form has expired, please reload the page and try again.'=>'此报名表单已过期，请重新加载页面后重试。','This booking has already been submitted, please check your email for its confirmation.'=>'此报名已提交，请查看您的邮箱以获取确认邮件。','This booking has already been submitted.'=>'此报名已提交。','This button text would be shown for a free booking'=>'免费报名时将显示此按钮文本','This cannot be undone.'=>'无法移除','This confirms receipt of your declaration only. We will review it and contact you regarding any refund due.'=>'这仅确认已收到您的声明。我们将进行审核，并就应退款项与您联系。','This content will appear just above your code for the %s list format below. Default is blank'=>'该内容将出现在您的 %s 列表格式的代码的上方。默认是空白','This content will appear just above your code for the default event list format. Default is blank'=>'此内容将出现在您的代码的默认活动的列表格式。默认值为空。','This content will appear just below your code for the %s list format above. Default is blank'=>'该内容将出现在您的 %s 列表格式的代码的上方。默认是空白','This content will appear just below your code for the default event list format. Default is blank'=>'这段内容竟会出现在您的代码下面作为默认活动列表模版的一部分。默认是空白','This disables user registrations for bookings.'=>'这将中止订位的用户注册。','This email already exists in our system, please log in to register to proceed with your booking.'=>'该邮箱在我们的系统中已经存在，请登录继续您的报名。','This event has been cancelled.'=>'此活动已被取消。','This event has ended and can no longer be joined.'=>'此活动已结束，无法再加入。','This event has no virtual location to join.'=>'此活动没有可加入的虚拟地址。','This event has validation errors and cannot be published until they are fixed:'=>'此活动存在验证错误，在修复之前无法发布：','This event is fully booked.'=>'该活动的预定已满额。','This event is not available or has been cancelled'=>'此活动不可用或已被取消','This event is not available or has been cancelled.'=>'此活动不可用或已被取消。','This event is not open for joining yet.'=>'此活动尚未开放加入。','This event spans every day between the beginning and end date, with start/end times applying to each day.'=>'这个活动每天进行，具体活动开始和结束时间以当天为准。','This file holds'=>'此文件包含','This is a %s event.'=>'这是一个%s活动。','This is a %s recurrence of %s.'=>'这是 %s 的一个重复实例，属于 %s。','This is a recurring %s. You can find all %s on this page, or click on individual %s to view recurrence-specific bookings.'=>'这是一个定期 %s。您可以在此页面找到所有 %s，也可以点击单个 %s 查看该重复实例的报名。','This is a translated event, therefore your time, location and booking information is handled by your original event translation.'=>'这是一个翻译活动，因此您的时间、地点和报名信息由原始活动翻译处理。','This is a translated location, so address information is handled by your original location translation. You can provide translations for certain fields which will override the original translation.'=>'这是一个翻译地点，因此地址信息由原始地点翻译处理。您可以为某些字段提供翻译，这些翻译将覆盖原始翻译。','This is also the default setting for responsive calendars without a fixed size.'=>'这也是未设固定尺寸的响应式日历的默认设置。','This is for advanced users, you should know what you\'re doing here or things will not work properly. For more information on how these options work see our <a href="%s" target="_blank">optimization recommendations</a>'=>'这是供高级用户使用的功能，你应清楚自己在做什么，否则功能将无法正常工作。有关这些选项如何运作的更多信息，请参阅我们的<a href="%s" target="_blank">优化建议</a>','This is not a required step to enable any extra functionality, and therefore is not urgent. Only until you are happy with the upgrade and are confident you don\'t need to downgrade, finalize your upgrade by deleting and discontinuing these fields.'=>'这不是启用任何额外功能的必要步骤，因此并不紧急。只有在您对升级满意并确信不需要降级后，才建议通过删除并停用这些字段来完成升级。','This is only applicable when %s is not active.'=>'仅在 %s 未启用时适用。','This is only used when showing events from other blogs.'=>'仅在显示来自其他站点的活动时使用。','This is sent when a person\'s booking is confirmed. This will be sent automatically if approvals are required and the booking is approved. If approvals are disabled, this is sent out when a user first submits their booking.'=>'当一个人的报名审核通过后这封邮件将被发送。若此报名需要批准且已批准通过他们将会被自动发送。若批准没有通过，当用户第一次发送他们的报名时此邮件也将被发送。','This is sent when a person\'s booking is pending. If approvals are enabled, this is sent out when a user first submits their booking.'=>'当某人的报名处于待审核状态时发送。如果启用了审批，则在用户首次提交报名时发送。','This is specific to bookings made by the user, not bookings that may have been made to events they own.'=>'这仅针对用户本人所做的报名，而不是对其拥有的活动所做的报名。','This is the definite date after which bookings will be closed for this event, regardless of individual ticket settings above. Default value will be the event start date.'=>'这是这个活动的预订关闭的确定日期，无论以上的单张票的设置。默认值将设定成活动的开始日期。','This is your primary recurrence, other recurring %s will use these advanced settings as their default settings if left blank.'=>'这是您的主要重复活动，如果留空，其他定期%s将使用这些高级设置作为默认设置。','This join link is not valid. Please use the link from your booking confirmation.'=>'此加入链接无效。请使用预约确认中的链接。','This link is invalid or has expired. Please request a new one.'=>'此链接无效或已过期。请重新申请。','This month'=>'本月','This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'此网络共用一套活动和报名数据表，从此站点卸载会永久删除网络中所有站点的活动和报名。请改为从%s卸载。','This only setting only matters if you selected \'Yes\' to above. You will notice the events page titles aren\'t being rewritten, and you have a new title underneath the default page name. This is where you control the HTML of this title. Make sure you keep the #_PAGETITLE placeholder here, as that\'s what is rewritten by events manager. To control what\'s rewritten in this title, see settings further down for page titles.'=>'如果以上您选择\'是\'。你会看到到活动页面标题没有被改写，在默认页面名称下有一个新的标题。这里你可以控制此标题网站。请务必在这里保持# _pagetitle占位符，这是活动负责人改写的标题。控制的改写了这个标题，设置进一步看到页面标题。','This option allows you to select the default category when adding an event.'=>'您可以在添加活动时通过此选项选择默认类别。','This option allows you to select the default location when adding an event.'=>'您可以在添加活动时通过此选项选择一个默认位置。','This option allows you to select which page to use as an events page. If you do not select an events page, to display event lists you can enable event archives or use the appropriate shortcodes and/or template tags.'=>'这个选项允许您选择哪个页面作为活动页面。如果您不选择一个活动页面，为了能显示活动列表，您可以启用存档或使用合适的短代码和/或模版标签。','This option allows you to select which page to use as the %s page.'=>'此选项供您选择哪个个页面作为 %s 页面。','This option allows you to select which page to use as the %s page. If you do not select a %s page, to display lists you can enable archives or use the appropriate shortcodes and/or template tags.'=>'您可以通过此选项选择一个页面作为 %s 页面。如果您不选择 %s 页面，为了能显示列表，您可以启用档案或者使用适当的短代码和/或模版标签。','This options allows to display the full-sized calendar on the events page, instead of the default list.'=>'此选项允许在活动页面上显示全尺寸日历，而不是默认的列表。','This page corresponds to the <strong>Events Manager</strong> %s page. Its content will be overridden by Events Manager, although if you include the word CONTENTS (exactly in capitals) and surround it with other text, only CONTENTS will be overwritten. If you want to change the way your events look, go to the <a href=\'%s\'>settings</a> page. '=>'此页面对应 <strong>Events Manager</strong> 的 %s 页面。其内容将被 Events Manager 覆盖，但如果您加入大写的 CONTENTS 一词并在其前后添加其他文字，则只有 CONTENTS 会被覆盖。如果您想更改活动的显示方式，请前往<a href=\'%s\'>设置</a>页面。 ','This page is where people that have made bookings for an event can go and view their previous bookings.'=>'已报名参加活动的用户可以在此页面查看他们之前的报名。','This section allows you to configure parts of this plugin that will improve performance on your site and increase page speeds by reducing extra files from being unnecessarily included on pages as well as reducing server loads where possible. This only applies to pages outside the admin area.'=>'此部分允许你配置此插件中可提升站点性能的部分，通过减少在页面上不必要加载的额外文件并尽可能降低服务器负载来加快页面速度。这仅适用于管理区域之外的页面。','This setting was not changed.'=>'此设置未更改。','This setting will be applied if you choose to specifically show a fixed-size %s calendar.'=>'如果你选择专门显示固定尺寸的 %s 日历，将应用此设置。','This setting will be applied if you choose to specifically show a size %s calendar.'=>'如果你选择专门显示 %s 尺寸的日历，将应用此设置。','This setting will not apply to bookings using payment gateways, see individual gateways for approval settings.'=>'此设置不适用于使用支付网关的报名，审核设置请参阅各个网关。','This site is activated under a license that has expired. Deactivate it from your licenses page, then activate it again here and choose your %s license.'=>'此站点是在已过期的许可证下激活的。请在您的许可证页面停用它，然后在此重新激活，并选择您的 %s 许可证。','This text will be shown only if the default (free) button is not an image.'=>'仅当默认（免费）按钮不是图片时才会显示此文本。','This ticket is the child of a recurring event ticket. Values can be overriden for this recurrence. Blank text values will default to the parent ticket value, checkboxes like this %s will inherit parent ticket values.'=>'此门票属于定期活动门票的子项。此重复实例的值可以被覆盖。留空的文本值将默认使用父级门票的值，像 %s 这样的复选框将继承父级门票的值。','This uses a slightly different format to the others on here, for a list of characters to use, visit the <a href="%s">reference page</a>'=>'此处使用的格式与此页其他格式略有不同，可用字符列表请访问<a href="%s">参考页面</a>','This week'=>'本周','This will be sent automatically when a booking is rejected. Not relevant if bookings don\'t require approval.'=>'当一份报名被拒绝时这份有奖将被自动发送。这与报名是否被批准没有关系。','This will be sent to event admins when a booking is rejected.'=>'报名被拒绝时，此电子邮件将发送给活动管理员。','This will be sent to the person when they first submit their booking. Not relevant if bookings don\'t require approval.'=>'当用户第一次发送他们的报名时这份邮件将被发送给他们。这与报名是否被批准没有关系。','This will be sent when a user cancels their booking.'=>'当有用户取消他的报名时这份邮件将被发送。','This will be used in admin menus and other areas identifying the type of %s you are working with.'=>'将用于管理菜单以及其他标识您正在处理的 %s 类型的位置。','This will control how many %s are shown on one list by default.'=>'这将控制默认有多少 %s 能显示在列表中。','This will control how many events are shown on one list by default.'=>'它将控制默认有多少活动显示在一个列表中。','This will delete all event recurrence posts/pages, and unify them into one URL. Any 404 pages resulting from these will automatically 302-redirect to the recurring event (which will be a new URL).'=>'这将删除所有活动重复实例的文章/页面，并将它们合并为一个网址。由此产生的任何 404 页面都会自动 302 重定向到该定期活动（它将使用新的网址）。','Thousands Separator'=>'千位分隔符','Thumbnails'=>'缩略图','Ticket'=>'门票','Ticket %s has a higher minimum spaces requirement than the maximum spaces allowed.'=>'门票 %s 的最低名额要求高于允许的最高名额。','Ticket Capacity'=>'门票容量','Ticket Description'=>'门票描述','Ticket ID'=>'门票ID','Ticket ID.'=>'门票 ID。','Ticket Name'=>'门票名称','Ticket Name (Ascending)'=>'门票名称（升序排列）','Ticket Name (Descending)'=>'门票名称（降序排列）','Ticket Options'=>'机票选项','Ticket Price'=>'门票价格','Ticket Price (Ascending)'=>'门票价格（升序排列）','Ticket Price (Descending)'=>'门票价格（降序排列）','Ticket Spaces'=>'门票名额','Ticket Total'=>'门票总计','Ticket Type'=>'门票类型','Ticket UUID'=>'门票 UUID','Ticket booking created'=>'票务订购完成','Ticket could not be deleted.'=>'无法删除门票。','Ticket could not be saved.'=>'无法保存门票。','Ticket created'=>'创建门票','Ticket for %s'=>'%s的门票','Ticket not found.'=>'未找到门票。','Tickets'=>'门票','Tickets / Booking'=>'门票 / 报名','Tickets and RSVPs'=>'门票和 RSVP','Tickets with bookings cannot be deleted.'=>'已有报名的门票无法删除。','Tickets within recurrences that already have bookings WILL NOT be deleted, the ticket will be deactivated instead to prevent further bookings.'=>'重复实例中已有报名的门票不会被删除，而是将被停用，以防止产生更多报名。','Tickets within recurrences without any bookings will be deleted.'=>'重复实例中没有任何报名的门票将被删除。','Time Format'=>'时间格式','Time Separator'=>'时间分离器','Time zone'=>'时区','Timerange'=>'时间范围','Timeranges cannot overlap with each other.'=>'时间范围之间不能重叠。','Times'=>'时间','Timeslot date format'=>'时段日期格式','Timeslot time format'=>'时段时间格式','Timeslots'=>'时间段','Timeslots require %s and has been disabled automatically to prevent undesired results.'=>'时段需要 %s，已自动停用以避免不良结果。','Timezone'=>'时区','Title'=>'标题','To help with the transition, we\'re providing you with a Preview mode you can activate below, which will temporarily use our new formatting options only for you to see (other site visitors will see your site as usual). If you\'re happy with the changes, you can switch over completely, or revert individual formats within these settings pages.'=>'为了帮助您顺利过渡，我们提供了可在下方启用的预览模式，它会临时仅对您显示新的格式选项（其他站点访客看到的仍是原来的站点）。如果您对更改满意，可以完全切换过去，也可以在这些设置页面中还原单个格式。','To manage the whole set, <a href="%s">edit the repeating event template</a>.'=>'要管理整个系列，请<a href="%s">编辑重复活动模板</a>。','To update your network blogs with the latest Events Manager automatically, click the update button below.'=>'用最新的活动管理器自动更新你的网络微博，点击下面的更新按钮。','To view your bookings, please visit %s after logging in.'=>'要查看您的报名，请在登录后访问 %s。','Today'=>'今天','Today\'s events'=>'今天的活动','Tomorrow\'s events'=>'明天的活动','Tooltip'=>'工具提示','Total'=>'所有','Total Bookings'=>'报名总数','Total Price'=>'总价','Total Sales'=>'销售总额','Total Spaces'=>'总共的空间','Total Tickets'=>'门票总数','Town'=>'城镇','Translated Event Information'=>'活动翻译信息','Translated Location Information'=>'地点翻译信息','Try again'=>'重试','Trying to perform an illegal action.'=>'正试图进行非法操作。','URL'=>'网址','URLs'=>'网址','Uh Oh! For some reason WordPress could not create an events page for you (or you just deleted it). Not to worry though, all you have to do is create an empty page, name it whatever you want, and select it as your events page in your <a href="%s">settings page</a>. Sorry for the extra step! If you know what you are doing, you may have done this on purpose, if so <a href="%s">ignore this message</a>'=>'呜呜！因为某些原因WordPress无法为你创建一个活动页面（或者你刚刚删除了它）。但是不要担心，你只需要创建一个空页面，随你喜好命名，然后在你的<a href="%s">设置页面</a>选择它作为你的活动页面。对此额外的步骤感到抱歉！如果你知道如何使用，你可能是故意这么做的，那么<a href="%s">请忽略这个提示</a>','Unapprove'=>'不同意','Unauthorized Access'=>'未经授权的访问','Unavailable Dates'=>'不可用日期','Unconfirm'=>'取消确认','Unconfirmed'=>'未确认','Undo'=>'解除','Undo Changes'=>'撤销更改','Undo Migration'=>'撤销迁移','Uninstall'=>'卸载','Uninstall Events Manager'=>'卸载活动管理器','Uninstall and Deactivate'=>'卸载和禁用','Uninstall/Reset'=>'卸载/重置','Unknown migration source.'=>'未知的迁移来源。','Unless overriden with the %s parameter in shortcode or PHP arguments, the calendar will by default split events by timeslot if on the same day or show one event for the day which includes the whole range of timeslots.'=>'除非在简码或 PHP 参数中使用 %s 参数覆盖，否则对于同一天的活动，日历默认会按时段拆分，或者只显示当天的一个活动并涵盖所有时段的范围。','Unless speficied with the %s parameter, the calendar will by default remain the chosen size regardless of calendar width. Responsive calendar size will adjust from small to large according to the calendar width on screen.'=>'除非使用 %s 参数指定，否则无论日历宽度如何，日历默认都将保持所选尺寸。响应式日历尺寸会根据日历在屏幕上的宽度在小到大之间调整。','Unrecognized file format, could not match file MIME type according to file extension.'=>'无法识别文件格式，无法根据文件扩展名匹配文件 MIME 类型。','Unrecognized image format, corrupted or non-present image EXIF header data.'=>'无法识别图像格式，图像 EXIF 头数据已损坏或不存在。','Up to %d%% off'=>'最高优惠 %d%%','Upcoming'=>'即将推出的活动','Upcoming %s'=>'即将举行的%s','Upcoming Events'=>'即将举行的活动','Upcoming timeslot limit'=>'即将开始的时段数量上限','Update %s'=>'更新 %s','Update 7.3.7 also includes improvements to the block (Gutenberg) editor. Check out our %s for the details.'=>'7.3.7 更新还包含对区块（Gutenberg）编辑器的改进。详情请查看我们的%s。','Update Blogs'=>'更新博客','Update Event Category'=>'更新活动类别','Update Event Tag'=>'更新活动标签','Update Network'=>'更新网络','Update booking'=>'更新报名','Update event'=>'更新活动','Update location'=>'更新地点','Update preview'=>'更新预览','Update process has finished.'=>'更新过程已完成。','Update ticket'=>'更新门票','Update your address information above to generate a preciese map location.'=>'请更新上方的地址信息以生成精确的地图位置。','Updated'=>'已更新','Updates an Events Manager %s.'=>'更新一个 Events Manager %s。','Updates an Events Manager booking. The payment gateway cannot be changed after the booking is made: sending a different gateway is rejected, and resending the current one is ignored.'=>'更新一个 Events Manager 报名。报名完成后无法更改支付网关：发送不同的网关将被拒绝，重新发送当前网关则会被忽略。','Updates an Events Manager event.'=>'更新一个 Events Manager 活动。','Updates an Events Manager location.'=>'更新一个 Events Manager 地点。','Updates an Events Manager ticket.'=>'更新一张 Events Manager 门票。','Updates and support until %s'=>'更新和支持至 %s','Upgrade to %s'=>'升级到 %s','Upgrade to %s for more options!'=>'升级到 %s 获取更多选项！','Upload Limits'=>'上传限制','Upload a file'=>'上传文件','Upload a file first.'=>'请先上传文件。','Upload and match columns'=>'上传并匹配列','Upload media'=>'上传媒体','Upload the zip under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'在“插件 > 添加新插件”下上传该 zip，然后在其设置中激活您的许可证。','Upload/change picture'=>'上传/更改图像','Uploaded file type not allowed. Permitted file types are: %s'=>'不允许上传该文件类型。允许的文件类型：%s','Uploads'=>'上传','Uploads an image (or other media) to the WordPress media library and returns its attachment ID. Accepts a `source_url` to sideload a public image, base64-encoded bytes via `content_base64` + `filename`, or an existing `id` to look up an existing attachment. If a public URL blocks server-side fetches (e.g. Unsplash) use `content_base64` instead. To make the upload an event/location featured image in one call, pass `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`; otherwise pass the returned ID as `featured_image` to update-event / update-location, or as `image` to update-category / update-tag. (Note: `post_id` only files the attachment under a post in the library — it does NOT set the featured image.)'=>'将图片（或其他媒体）上传到 WordPress 媒体库并返回其附件 ID。可接受用于获取公开图片的 `source_url`、通过 `content_base64` + `filename` 提供的 base64 编码字节，或用于查找现有附件的现有 `id`。如果公开 URL 阻止服务器端抓取（例如 Unsplash），请改用 `content_base64`。要在一次调用中将上传内容设为活动/地点的特色图片，请传入 `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`；否则，请将返回的 ID 作为 `featured_image` 传给 update-event / update-location，或作为 `image` 传给 update-category / update-tag。（注意：`post_id` 仅将附件归入媒体库中的某篇文章下，不会设置特色图片。）','Use 24h Format?'=>'使用24小时制？','Use Defaults'=>'使用默认值','Use SMTP authentication?'=>'使用SMTP认证?','Use Visual Editor?'=>'使用可视化编辑器？','Use abbreviations, e.g. Friday = Fri. Useful for certain languages where abbreviations differ from full names.'=>'使用简写，比如 Friday = Fri。 对某些语言中简写和全名不同的情况下很有用。','Use dropdown for locations?'=>'使用下拉菜单获取地址？','Use international format starting with `+` and a country code, e.g. `+447400123456`.'=>'请使用以 `+` 和国家代码开头的国际格式，例如 `+447400123456`。','Use the UI builder below to create and manage additional event types (archetypes).'=>'使用下方的界面构建器创建和管理额外的活动类型（原型）。','Use the buttons below to uninstall Events Manager completely from your system or reset Events Manager to original settings and keep your event data.'=>'使用下面的按钮来从你的系统上完整地卸载或者重置活动管理器到原始的设置，并且保留你的活动资料。','Used if an excerpt has been defined.'=>'已定义摘要时使用。','Used if an excerpt has not been defined.'=>'未定义摘要时使用。','Used to format each event in a list when previewing a single date in a modal popup.'=>'在模态弹窗中预览单个日期时，用于格式化列表中的每个活动。','Used to show a single event when preview mode is set to %s.'=>'预览模式设置为 %s 时用于显示单个活动。','User Capabilities'=>'用户功能','User Fields'=>'用户版块','User can book'=>'用户可以报名','User can create and edit %s'=>'用户可以创建和编辑 %s','User can delete %s categories and tags.'=>'用户可以删除 %s 类别和标签。','User can delete other users %s'=>'用户可以删除其他用户的 %s','User can delete their own %s'=>'用户可以删除他自己的 %s','User can edit %s categories and tags.'=>'用户可以编辑 %s 类别和标签。','User can edit other users %s'=>'用户可以编辑其他用户的 %s','User can manage other users individual bookings and event booking settings.'=>'用户可以管理其他用户的个人报名和活动订购设置。','User can upload images along with their events and locations.'=>'用户可以在上传他们的活动和位置时的同时上传图像。','User can use and manage bookings with their events.'=>'用户可以使用和管理他们自己活动的报名。','User can use other user locations for their events.'=>'用户可以使用该活动的其它位置。','User can view private %s'=>'用户可以查看私人 %s','User must log in'=>'用户必须登录','Username'=>'用户名','Username: %s'=>'用户名：%s','Users can manage bookings for their events on this page.'=>'用户可以在此页面中管理他们的活动。','Users can now use the WordPress editor for easy HTML entry in the submission form.'=>'用户现在可以在发送表单中使用WordPress编辑简单HTML条目。','Users can publish %s and skip any admin approval'=>'用户可以发布 %s 并跳过任何管理员的批准','Users can view their bookings for other events on this page.'=>'用户可以再此页面中浏览他们对别的活动的报名。','Users can view, add and edit their %s on this page.'=>'用户可以在此页面中查看，添加和编辑他们的 %s。','Users will be able to create additional custom event post types on their own sub-sites.'=>'用户将能够在各自的子站点上创建额外的自定义活动文章类型。','Users with accounts (which would be created by other means when this mode is enabled) will still be able to log in and make bookings linked to their account as normal.'=>'已有账户的用户（启用此模式后，这类账户需通过其他方式创建）仍可正常登录并进行与其账户关联的报名。','Users with the relevant permissions can manage their own events and bookings to these events on the following pages.'=>'拥有相应权限的用户可以在以下页面管理自己的活动以及这些活动的报名。','Value'=>'值','Venue capacity, shared by all tickets that include physical access. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'场地容量，由所有包含实体参与权限的门票共用。留空表示不限制。','Venues'=>'场地','View'=>'查看','View %s'=>'查看 %s','View As'=>'查看方式','View Bookings'=>'查看报名','View Event'=>'查看活动','View Event Bookings'=>'查看活动报名','View Location'=>'查看位置','View Range'=>'查看范围','View Timeslot'=>'查看时间段','View Types'=>'视图类型','View all posts in %s'=>'在 %s中查看所有帖子','View event details'=>'查看活动详情','View license'=>'查看许可证','View/Edit Event'=>'查看/编辑 活动','Viewing a general WordPress taxonomy page such as %s will show a list of events just like it would regular posts for a regular category or tag. Below you can edit things such as the order events are displayed, or completely override the archive look with our formats feature.'=>'查看 %s 等常规 WordPress 分类法页面时，会像常规类别或标签的文章一样显示活动列表。您可以在下方编辑活动的显示顺序等内容，或使用我们的形式功能完全覆盖归档外观。','Views'=>'视图','Virtual'=>'虚拟','Virtual Events'=>'虚拟活动','Virtual Locations'=>'虚拟地址','Virtual Platform'=>'虚拟平台','Virtual Spaces'=>'虚拟名额','Virtual Venue'=>'虚拟场地','Virtual and Hybrid Events'=>'虚拟和混合活动','Virtual capacity, shared by all tickets that include virtual access. Leave blank for no limit, or the limit of your virtual platform if it has one.'=>'虚拟容量，由所有包含虚拟参与权限的门票共用。留空表示不限制，如果您的虚拟平台有限制，则以其限制为准。','Virtual events only'=>'仅限虚拟活动','WARNING : Restrict your API key to prevent unauthorized use and quota theft. See our %s page for more information.'=>'警告：请限制你的 API 密钥以防止未经授权的使用和配额被盗用。更多信息请参阅我们的%s页面。','WARNING! This cannot be undone and will overwrite all event timezones, you may want to back up your database first!'=>'警告！此操作无法撤销，并将覆盖所有活动时区，建议先备份数据库！','WARNING! You will delete ALL recurrences of this event, including booking history associated with any event in this recurrence. To keep booking information, go to the relevant single event and save it to detach it from this recurrence series.'=>'警告！您将会删除此定期活动的所有重复活动,包括与此定期活动相关联的任何一项活动的订购历史。若想保留订购信息,请去相应的每一项活动将它与此定期活动分离。','WARNING: This action cannot be undone.'=>'警告：此操作无法撤销。','WARNING: This is a %s.'=>'警告：这是一个%s。','WARNING: This is a event belonging to the group "%s". Other group admins can also modify this event.'=>'警告:此活动归属组别 "%s"。其它组别的管理员也可以修改此活动。','WARNING: This is a recurrence in a set of repeating events.'=>'警告：这是一组重复活动中的一个重复实例。','WP FullCalendar'=>'WP FullCalendar','WPML Compatibility'=>'WPML 兼容性','Waiting to sync with the provider.'=>'正在等待与服务提供方同步。','Waitlist'=>'候补名单','Waitlist Approved'=>'候补已批准','Waitlist Expired'=>'候补已过期','Want to use the block editor? You can now enable this on your %s page.'=>'想使用区块编辑器？您现在可以在%s页面中启用。','Warning!'=>'警告！','Warning: Changing the CPT name can have wider implications and may affect any other plugins that specifically work with this custom post type name. Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'警告：更改 CPT 名称可能产生更广泛的影响，并可能影响其他专门使用该自定义文章类型名称的插件。确定要继续吗？','Warning: Changing these values may result in exposing previously hidden information to all users.'=>'警告：改变这些值将导致过去隐藏的信息暴露给所有用户。','We are going to use %s for searching.'=>'我们将使用 %s 进行搜索。','We collect and store information you submit to us about events (and corresponding locations) you would like to publish on our site.'=>'我们会收集并存储您提交给我们的、希望发布到本站的活动（及相应地点）信息。','We collect and store information you submit to us when making a booking, for the purpose of reserving your requested spaces at our event and maintaining a record of attendance.'=>'我们会收集并存储您在报名时提交给我们的信息，用于为您预留所需的活动名额并保存出席记录。','We could not find a booking matching that reference and email address. Please check both and try again.'=>'找不到与该编号和邮箱地址匹配的报名。请检查两者后重试。','We could not find any active bookings for your email address.'=>'找不到与您的邮箱地址关联的任何有效报名。','We could not verify that booking. Please start again.'=>'无法验证该报名。请重新开始。','We impose some theme styling rules which help normalize the look of Events Manager accross themes and overrides general theming. This is limited to our components but will prevent your theme from taking over things like fonts, font-sizes, form structures etc. You can also disable strict styling for individual components below.'=>'我们设置了一些主题样式规则，有助于统一 Events Manager 在不同主题下的外观，并覆盖常规主题样式。这仅限于我们的组件，但会阻止您的主题接管字体、字号、表单结构等内容。您也可以在下方为各个组件单独停用严格样式。','We may use cookies to temporarily store information about a booking in progress as well as any error/confirmation messages whilst submitting or managing your events and locations.'=>'我们可能会使用 Cookie 临时存储正在进行的报名信息，以及您提交或管理活动和地点时的错误/确认消息。','We recommend enabling this feature, as all numbers are stored in the international standard %s. Even if you require national numbers from one country, to ensure compatibility with all phone-related features, otherwise a simple text field is provided for phone input.'=>'建议启用此功能，因为所有号码都以国际标准 %s 存储。即使你只要求某一个国家的本国号码，也应如此，以确保与所有电话相关功能兼容，否则将仅提供简单的文本字段用于输入电话。','We recommend leaving this on unless you are experiencing issues configuring your email.'=>'除非您在配置邮件时遇到问题，否则建议保持开启。','We recommend you back up your database! Once the upgrade is finalized, you cannot downgrade to an earlier version of the plugin. This cannot be undone.'=>'我们建议您备份数据库！升级完成后，您将无法降级到插件的早期版本。此操作无法撤销。','We strongly recommend you check out our %s before disabling any styling here, in most cases you can make profound changes with a few line of CSS or PHP'=>'在停用此处的任何样式之前，我们强烈建议您查看我们的 %s，在大多数情况下，只需几行 CSS 或 PHP 就能做出重大改动','We strongly suggest you back up your database before proceding with this action, it cannot be undone otherwise!'=>'强烈建议您在执行此操作前先备份数据库，否则无法撤销！','We use Google services to generate maps and provide autocompletion when searching for events by location, which may collect data via your browser in accordance to Google\'s <a href="%s">privacy policy</a>.'=>'我们使用 Google 服务生成地图，并在按地点搜索活动时提供自动补全功能，您的浏览器可能会根据 Google 的<a href="%s">隐私政策</a>收集数据。','We will attempt to detect the location of the user based on their browser timezone and auto-select the corresponding country accordingly.'=>'我们将尝试根据用户浏览器的时区检测其所在位置，并自动选择相应的国家。','We\'re always making improvements, adding features and fixing bugs between releases. We incrementally make these changes in between updates and make it available as a development version. You can download these manually, but we\'ve made it easy for you. <strong>Warning:</strong> Development versions are not always fully tested before release, use wisely!'=>'我们总是在每次发布之间进行改善，添加新的功能，以及修正bugs。我们在更新之间逐渐添加这些变化，并且将它当作开发版本发行。你可以手动下载这些，但是我们希望带给你方便。<strong>警告：</strong>开发版本在发行之前并非总是经过测试的，请慎重使用。','Website'=>'网站','Week %d'=>'第 %d 周','Weekly'=>'每周','Welcome to Events Manager v6! This latest update includes some major UI improvements, which requires you to update your formats.'=>'欢迎使用 Events Manager v6！此次更新包含一些重大的界面改进，需要您更新您的格式。','What the file holds'=>'文件包含的内容','When'=>'时间','When Events Manager displays lists of events the default behavior is ordering by start date in ascending order. To change this, modify the values above.'=>'默认设置下活动列表按开始日期升序。若想修改，改变上栏的排序标准。','When a booking cannot be made due to an error when filling the form. Below this, there will be a dynamic list of errors.'=>'当填表格时由于错误导致报名无法完成，在下面会显示一个动态的错误清单。','When a booking cannot be made due to lack of spaces.'=>'当报名因席位不足而无法完成时','When a booking is made by a user, a feedback message is shown depending on the result, which can be customized below.'=>'当用户下完报名后，一条取决于不同结果的反馈信息将会显示，它可以再下面自定义。','When a booking is registered and confirmed.'=>'当报名被注册并确认了','When a booking is registered but pending.'=>'当报名被注册但未被审核。','When a guest tries to book using an email registered with a user account.'=>'当一个游客试图用一个电子邮件注册的账户下报名时。','When a guest user makes a booking for the first time in Events Manager, a new user account is created for them and they are sent their credentials in a separate email, which can be modified below.'=>'访客用户首次在 Events Manager 中报名时，系统会为其创建新的用户账户，并通过单独的电子邮件发送其登录凭据，该邮件可在下方修改。','When a user cancels their booking, this message will be displayed confirming the cancellation.'=>'当一个用户取消他的报名时，这个消息将被发送来确认是否真的取消。','When a user chooses to cancel a booking, this warning is displayed for them to confirm.'=>'当用户选择取消报名时，他们将收到这份警告来确认是否删除。','When a user modifies a previously published event, it will be put back into pending review status and will not be published until you re-approve it.'=>'当一个用户修改了一个以及发布的活动，它将被改回等待检阅状态，并且在你重新批准之前将不会被发布。','When a user must log in before making a booking.'=>'在下报名前用户必须登录','When a user submits their event, you can display a new event form again.'=>'当一个用户发送他们的活动，您可以再显示一个新的活动表单。','When an event is cancelled, a general email is sent to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled.'=>'活动被取消时，会向该活动所有已确认和待审核的报名发送一封通用电子邮件。','When creating a new event, this timezone will be applied by default.'=>'创建新活动时，将默认应用此时区。','When creating events, would you like your times to be shown in 24 hour format?'=>'您希望在创建活动时您的时间用24小时制显示吗？','When displaying embedded maps for a location, choose what information Google will use to generate a map from, each producing varying results.'=>'显示某个位置的嵌入式地图时，选择 Google 用于生成地图的信息，不同选择会产生不同的结果。','When displaying global %s on the main site you have the option of users viewing the %s details on the main site or being directed to the sub-site.'=>'当在主站点显示全球%s ，你有选择让用户在主站点看%s详细信息或者直接被带到子网站。','When displaying ticket prices and booking totals, include the tax automatically?'=>'当显示票价和订购总额时，自动包括税吗？','When enabled, phone number fields will include special international (or national) formatting and validation.'=>'启用后，电话号码字段将包含特殊的国际（或国内）格式和验证。','When enabled, the mobile app can register devices and receive push notifications. Turning this off stops all outgoing pushes and hides the notification options in the app for this site.'=>'启用后，移动应用可以注册设备并接收推送通知。关闭此项将停止所有外发推送，并在应用中隐藏此站点的通知选项。','When enabled, users can custom-order their tickets using drag and drop. If enabled, saved ordering supercedes the default ticket ordering below.'=>'启用后，用户可以通过拖放来自定义门票顺序。启用时，已保存的排序将优先于下方的默认门票排序。','When listing categories, this order is applied.'=>'当类别排序的时候，这个顺序将被使用。','When listing event archives for a %s, this order is applied.'=>'列出某个 %s 的活动归档时，将应用此顺序。','When listing tags, this order is applied.'=>'列出标签时，将应用此顺序。','When no tickets are selected, this text will appear in place of a booking summary, prompting users to select a ticket.'=>'未选择任何门票时，此文本将代替报名摘要显示，提示用户选择门票。','When selecting tickets on a booking form, the price will dynamically be broken down in a summary before the booking confirmation button.'=>'在报名表单上选择门票时，价格明细会动态显示在报名确认按钮之前的摘要中。','When submitting events, you can choose to use a single date picker for start/end dates, or separate fields for each date.'=>'提交活动时，你可以选择为开始/结束日期使用单个日期选择器，或为每个日期使用单独的字段。','When the booking is cancelled, the cancellation status email can also be sent independently of a general event cancellation notification.'=>'报名被取消时，也可以独立于通用的活动取消通知，单独发送取消状态电子邮件。','When the size of the %s is less than %s, the search fields and buttons in the main bar can either remain on one line and resize accordingly, or break into multiple lines. If you want to keep all your search terms options, multiple lines will look better as they will look squashed on smaller screens and provide a worse search exprience. You can also hide individual search fields in settings further down to reduce screen clutter as the search from shrinks.'=>'当 %s 的尺寸小于 %s 时，主栏中的搜索字段和按钮可以保持在一行并相应缩放，也可以拆分为多行。如果想保留所有搜索条件选项，多行会更美观，因为在较小屏幕上单行会显得拥挤，搜索体验也更差。你还可以在下方的设置中隐藏个别搜索字段，以便在搜索表单缩小时减少界面杂乱。','When the size of the %s is less than %s, this field can be hidden on the main search form to save viewing space. You can still enable this field to show in advanced search settings.'=>'当 %s 的尺寸小于 %s 时，可在主搜索表单中隐藏此字段以节省显示空间。你仍可在高级搜索设置中启用此字段使其显示。','When you save this %s, all recurrences of this set will be deleted. Would you like to proceed?'=>'保存此%s时，该组的所有重复实例都将被删除。是否继续？','Where'=>'地点','Whether this ticket lets attendees attend physically, virtually, or both, on a hybrid event.'=>'在混合活动中，此门票是让参会者到现场参加、虚拟参加，还是两者皆可。','Why'=>'原因','Will be imported'=>'将被导入','Will be skipped'=>'将被跳过','With the %s placeholder, the below texts will be used.'=>'使用 %s 占位符时，将使用以下文本。','Withdrawal page'=>'撤回页面','Withdrawal period (days)'=>'撤回期限（天）','Withdrawal policy / instructions'=>'撤回政策/说明','Withdrawal received for booking #%d'=>'已收到报名 #%d 的撤回申请','Within'=>'内','Within the network admin area, only network-specific settings will be exported or imported. For individual site settings please visit the relevant site within your network.'=>'在网络管理区域中，只会导出或导入网络专用的设置。如需单个站点的设置，请访问网络中的相应站点。','WooCommerce sold separately on Woo.com'=>'WooCommerce 在 Woo.com 单独销售','WooCommerce ticket orders become'=>'WooCommerce 门票订单变为','WordPress %s Archives'=>'WordPress %s 档案','Work it out from the file'=>'根据文件自动判断','Would you like to allow users to submit bookings anonymously? If so, you can use the new [event_form] shortcode or <code>em_event_form()</code> template tag with this enabled.'=>'您允许用户匿名发送报名吗？如果是，您可以使用新 [event_form]短代码或者 <code>em_event_form()</code> 启用的模版标签。','Yearly'=>'每年','Yes'=>'是','Yesterday'=>'昨天','You <strong>must</strong> have assigned a %s page in your <a href="%s">main blog settings</a> for this to work.'=>'你<strong>必须</strong>已经分配了一个%s页在你的<a href="%s">主博客设置</a>上，这个才能使用。','You already have booked a seat at this event.'=>'您已经报名了这项活动的一个席位。','You are adding unavailable dates.'=>'您正在添加不可用日期。','You are currently attending this event.'=>'您目前正在参与此活动。','You are currently viewing options for an archetype. These can override the default options with the follwoing available options.'=>'您当前正在查看某个原型的选项。这些选项可以覆盖默认选项，以下为可用选项。','You are currently viewing your public page, this is what other users will see.'=>'您现在正在浏览您的公共主页，其他用户也将看得到该主页。','You are in Events Manager debug mode. To turn debug mode off, go to the <a href="%s">settings</a> page.'=>'您现在在活动管理调试模式中。若要将调试模式关闭，请链接到<a href="%s">settings</a> 页面。','You are successfully connected to the following %s account:'=>'您已成功连接到以下%s账户：','You are switching location type, if you update this event your event previous location data will be deleted.'=>'您正在切换地点类型，如果更新此活动，活动之前的地点数据将被删除。','You are trying to book a non-existent ticket for this event.'=>'您正在试图订购一张不存在的活动门票。','You are viewing individual recurrences of %s.'=>'您正在查看%s的单个重复实例。','You can add private notes below for internal reference that only event managers will see.'=>'您可以在下面添加私人笔记作为内部参考，只有活动管理者才看得到。','You can add styles to your maps to give them a unique look. Build one using the %s or choose from the many free templates on %s paste the generated JSON code here.'=>'你可以为地图添加样式，使其外观独一无二。可使用%s创建，或从 %s 上的众多免费模板中选择，然后将生成的 JSON 代码粘贴到此处。','You can allow different location types which can be assigned to an event. For more information see our %s.'=>'你可以允许将不同的位置类型分配给活动。更多信息请参阅我们的%s。','You can allow users to publicly submit events on your blog by using the %s shortcode, and enabling anonymous submissions below.'=>'用户可以使用短代码%s在您的博客上公开发送活动，也可以在下面选择匿名发送。','You can also %s into a single recurring event.'=>'您也可以%s转换为单个定期活动。','You can also add event attributes here, one per line in this format <code>#_ATT{key}</code>. They will not appear on event pages unless you insert them into another template below, but you may want to store extra information about an event for other uses. <a href=\'%s\'>More information on placeholders.</a>'=>'你也可以在此添加活动属性，每行一个，格式为 <code>#_ATT{key}</code>。除非你将它们插入下方的其他模板中，否则它们不会显示在活动页面上，但你可能想为其他用途存储活动的额外信息。<a href=\'%s\'>更多关于占位符的信息。</a>','You can also add location attributes here, one per line in this format <code>#_LATT{key}</code>. They will not appear on location pages unless you insert them into another template below, but you may want to store extra information about an event for other uses. <a href=\'%s\'>More information on placeholders.</a>'=>'您也可以在此添加位置属性，以此格式每行一个 <code>#_LATT{key}</code>。它们并不会出现在位置页面中，除非您将它们输入进另一个以下的模版中，但您可能为了其他用途想要储存额外的关于一个活动的信息。<a href=\'%s\'>占位符的更多信息</a>','You can also request specific consent from your users to be contacted via supplied communication options (Email, Phone, SMS, WhatsApp, Facebook, Telegram etc.), this can be separate to your privacy policy, given that this relates to consenting to non-essential communication such as marketing or non-email-based reminders.'=>'您还可以请求用户明确同意通过其提供的通信方式（电子邮件、电话、短信、WhatsApp、Facebook、Telegram 等）与其联系。鉴于这涉及同意接收营销或非电子邮件提醒等非必要通信，此项可以与您的隐私政策分开。','You can also reset all events of a blog to a new timezone in %s'=>'您还可以在 %s 中将博客的所有活动重置为新时区','You can change the permalink structure of your events, locations, categories and tags here. Be aware that you may want to set up redirects if you change your permalink structures to maintain SEO rankings.'=>'你可以在此改变你的活动的固定链接结构，地点，类别和标签。注意你可能要设置重定向，如果你改变你的固定链接结构来保持SEO排行。','You can choose to show a popup modal or inline under the main search bar triggered by an icon on the main search bar.'=>'你可以选择通过主搜索栏上的图标触发，以弹出模态框或在主搜索栏下方内联的方式显示。','You can choose whether or not to show unavailable tickets to visitors.'=>'您可以选择是否对游客显示不可用门票。','You can create more than one "type" of event, which can have its own admin section, URL structure, calendar and formatting. For example, you may have events, appointments, and workshops all running under the Events Manager engine!'=>'您可以创建多种活动“类型”，每种类型都可以拥有自己的管理区域、网址结构、日历和格式。例如，您可以让活动、预约和工作坊全部运行在 Events Manager 引擎下！','You can disable ALL styling altogether by setting this to \'no\'. By doing so, nothing will be styled, AT ALL, by Events Manager in the front-end. Basically, it\'s up to you and your theme!'=>'将此项设置为“否”可完全停用所有样式。这样，Events Manager 在前端将完全不会设置任何样式。一切由您和您的主题决定！','You can disable this email by leaving the subject blank.'=>'你可以通过空置主题栏将这封电邮关闭。','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with a %s to prevent getting overwritten.'=>'您可以编辑单个重复实例，并将其与%s分离，以防止被覆盖。','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this %s.'=>'您可以编辑单个重复实例，并将其与此%s分离。','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this recurring event.'=>'您可以编辑单个重复实例，并将其与此定期活动分离。','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this repeating event.'=>'您可以编辑单个重复实例，并将其与此重复活动分离。','You can have single or multiple tickets, where certain tickets become available under certain conditions, e.g. early bookings, group discounts, maximum bookings per ticket, etc.'=>'你可以有单张或者多张票，在某些情况下某些票可用。例如，提前预订，团体优惠，每张票的最大预订等。','You can hide or leave the consent box checked for registered users who have provided consent previously.'=>'对于之前已提供同意的注册用户，您可以隐藏同意框或保持其勾选状态。','You can join from %s.'=>'您可以从 %s 起加入。','You can log into our site here : %s'=>'您可以在此登录我们的站点：%s','You can now give fine grained control with regards to what your users can do with events. Each user role can have perform different sets of actions.'=>'你现在可以给与你的用户针对活动的更细节的控制。每个用户可以执行不同的指令。','You can only convert a repeating %s'=>'您只能转换重复的%s','You can reset your events to a new timezone and also complete the final migration step by deleting unecessary data in %s'=>'您可以将活动重置为新时区，并通过删除 %s 中不必要的数据来完成最后一步迁移','You can use Google Maps to show where your events are located. For more information on using maps, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a>.'=>'你可以使用谷歌地图来显示你的活动的位置。欲了解更多使用地图的信息，<a href="%s">请参照我们的文档</a>。','You can view your event here:'=>'您可以在此查看您的活动：','You cannot RSVP to this booking with %s'=>'您不能使用 %s 回复此报名的邀请','You cannot book more than %1$d spaces for the ticket %2$s.'=>'您不能为门票 %2$s 报名超过 %1$d 个名额。','You cannot book more than %d spaces for this event.'=>'您不能为此活动报名超过 %d 个名额。','You cannot change the CPT type of %s to %s. This custom post type already exists.'=>'您无法将 %s 的 CPT 类型更改为 %s。此自定义文章类型已存在。','You cannot delete a ticket that has a booking on it.'=>'您无法删除已被登记的门票','You cannot delete tickets if there are any bookings associated with them. Please delete these bookings first.'=>'您无法删除与其他报名相关联的报名。请首先删除那些相关联的报名。','You cannot edit saved locations here.'=>'您无法编辑这里已被保存的地址。','You cannot manage this %s.'=>'您无法管理这个 %s。','You cannot read private %s'=>'您无法阅读私人 %s','You cannot view others %s'=>'您无法查看私人 %s','You do not have any bookings.'=>'您没有任何报名。','You do not have permission to attach media to that post.'=>'您没有将媒体附加到该文章的权限。','You do not have permission to change this booking status.'=>'您没有更改此报名状态的权限。','You do not have permission to create bookings through the API.'=>'您没有通过 API 创建报名的权限。','You do not have permission to create/edit %s.'=>'您无权创建/编辑 %s。','You do not have permission to delete %s'=>'您无权删除 %s','You do not have permission to delete event terms.'=>'您没有删除活动项的权限。','You do not have permission to delete others %s'=>'您无权删除别人的 %s','You do not have permission to delete this booking.'=>'您没有删除此报名的权限。','You do not have permission to delete this event.'=>'您没有删除此活动的权限。','You do not have permission to delete this location.'=>'您没有删除此地点的权限。','You do not have permission to delete this ticket.'=>'您没有删除此门票的权限。','You do not have permission to do that.'=>'您无权执行此操作。','You do not have permission to edit %s'=>'您无权编辑 %s','You do not have permission to edit others %s'=>'您无权编辑别人的 %s','You do not have permission to edit that event, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'您没有编辑该活动的权限，因此上传的图片未被设为其特色图片。','You do not have permission to edit that location, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'您没有编辑该地点的权限，因此上传的图片未被设为其特色图片。','You do not have permission to edit this attachment.'=>'您没有编辑此附件的权限。','You do not have permission to edit this event.'=>'您没有编辑此活动的权限。','You do not have permission to manage %s'=>'您无权管理 %s','You do not have permission to manage event terms.'=>'您没有管理活动项的权限。','You do not have permission to manage others %s'=>'您无权管理别人的 %s','You do not have permission to manage this booking.'=>'您无权管理此报名。','You do not have permission to manage tickets for this event.'=>'您没有管理此活动门票的权限。','You do not have permission to migrate data.'=>'您无权迁移数据。','You do not have permission to publish %s'=>'您无权发布 %s','You do not have permission to save this booking.'=>'您没有保存此报名的权限。','You do not have permission to save this event.'=>'您没有保存此活动的权限。','You do not have permission to save this location.'=>'您没有保存此地点的权限。','You do not have permission to send a test email, or this page has expired. Please reload the settings page and try again.'=>'您无权发送测试邮件，或此页面已过期。请重新加载设置页面后重试。','You do not have permission to update this ticket.'=>'您没有更新此门票的权限。','You do not have permission to upload images'=>'您无权上传图像','You do not have permission to upload media.'=>'您没有上传媒体的权限。','You do not have permission to view this booking.'=>'您没有查看此报名的权限。','You do not have permission to view this event.'=>'您没有查看此活动的权限。','You do not have permission to view this location.'=>'您没有查看此地点的权限。','You do not have permission to view this ticket.'=>'您没有查看此门票的权限。','You do not have the rights to manage this %s.'=>'您无权管理这个 %s。','You do not have the rights to manage this event.'=>'您无法管理此活动。','You do not have the rights to manage this ticket.'=>'您无权管理此门票','You don\'t have any custom attributes defined in any of your Events Manager template settings. Please add them the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>'=>'在您的活动管理模版设置中还没有任何自定义的属性。请在<a href=\'%s\'>设置页面</a>中添加。','You don\'t have any custom attributes defined in any of your Locations Manager template settings. Please add them the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>'=>'在你的位置管理器模版设置中你没有定义任何自定义属性。请添加它们到<a href=\'%s\'>设置页面</a>','You have %s confirmed bookings'=>'您有 %s 个已确认的报名','You have %s pending bookings'=>'您有 %s 个待审核的报名','You have a confirmed booking'=>'您有一个已确认的报名','You have a pending booking'=>'您有一个待审核的报名','You have chosen to add or edit your current unavailable dates for all recurrences. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'您选择了为所有重复活动添加或编辑当前的不可用日期。请仔细阅读此警告！','You have chosen to edit your %s times. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'您选择了编辑%s时间。请仔细阅读此警告！