 ticket %2$s.'=>'您必须为门票 %2$s 至少报名 %1$d 个名额。','You must check the box allowing us to communicate with you via your provided contact methods.'=>'您必须勾选此框，允许我们通过您提供的联系方式与您联系。','You must log in or register to make a booking.'=>'您必须登录或注册后才能报名。','You must log in to cancel your booking.'=>'您必须登录来取消您的报名。','You must log in to view and manage your bookings.'=>'您必须登录才能查看和管理您的报名。','You must log in to view and manage your events.'=>'您必须登录才能查看和管理您的活动。','You must log in to view and manage your locations.'=>'您必须登录才能查看和管理您的位置。','You must request at least one space to book an event.'=>'您必须有至少一个空间来报名一项活动。','You nave successfully migrated to the default v6 formatting options, enjoy! We have an undo option, just in case...'=>'您已成功迁移到默认的 v6 格式选项，尽情享用吧！我们提供了撤销选项，以防万一...','You will also need supply an OAuth redirect url to %s. Your url for this site is : %s'=>'您还需要向%s提供 OAuth 重定向网址。此站点的网址为：%s','You\'ll need to create an App with %s and obtain the App credentials by going to %s.'=>'您需要在 %s 创建一个应用，并前往 %s 获取应用凭据。','Your %s details are incorrect and cannot be published, please correct these errors first:'=>'您的 %s 详情并不正确，所以无法发布，请首先纠正这些错误：','Your %s license includes this add-on.'=>'您的 %s 许可证包含此附加组件。','Your Details'=>'你的详细资料','Your account has been successfully connected with %s!'=>'您的账户已成功与 %s 连接!','Your booking does not include virtual access to this event, or it is not confirmed yet.'=>'您的报名不包含此活动的虚拟参与权限，或尚未确认。','Your booking emails show the venue to every attendee, including those with virtual-only tickets. Use %1$s for the Where line in %2$s so each attendee sees the venue, their join link or both.'=>'您的报名邮件会向每位参会者显示场地，包括仅持虚拟门票的参会者。请在 %2$s 中的“地点”行使用 %1$s，这样每位参会者都会看到场地、其加入链接或两者。','Your booking has been recorded'=>'您的预订已经记录在案','Your booking is now unconfirmed'=>'您的报名现在处于未确认状态','Your confirmed booking email has no join link, so attendees with virtual access will not receive one by email. Add %1$s to it in %2$s.'=>'您的报名确认邮件中没有加入链接，因此拥有虚拟参与权限的参会者不会通过邮件收到链接。请在 %2$s 中将 %1$s 添加到其中。','Your current settings will be saved for this selected view.'=>'您当前的设置将保存到所选视图。','Your declaration of withdrawal has been received.'=>'您的撤销声明已收到。','Your event #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been approved.'=>'您的活动 #_EVENTNAME（#_EVENTDATES）已通过审核。','Your event details are incorrect and recurrences cannot be created, please correct these errors first:'=>'您的活动详情并不正确，所有定期活动无法被创建，请首先纠正这些错误：','Your hold on these spaces has ended. You can still book them while they are available.'=>'您对这些名额的保留已结束。只要仍有余量，您仍然可以报名。','Your last attempt to reset all blogs to a certain timezone did not complete successfully. You can attempt to reset only those blogs that weren\'t completed by selecting your desired timezone again and then %s from the dropdowns below'=>'您上一次将所有博客重置为某个时区的尝试未成功完成。您可以再次选择所需的时区，然后在下方下拉菜单中选择%s，只重置尚未完成的博客','Your name'=>'你的名字','Your own legal withdrawal policy and model withdrawal form, shown on the withdrawal page. Events Manager does not generate legal text — paste your own from your legal adviser.'=>'您自己的法律撤回政策和撤回表格范本，显示在撤回页面上。Events Manager 不生成法律文本，请粘贴您从法律顾问处获得的文本。','Your plan'=>'您的方案','Your search filter settings will be selected automatically.'=>'您的搜索筛选设置将被自动选中。','Your session expired, please try again.'=>'您的会话已过期，请重试。','Your spaces are held for %s while you complete your booking.'=>'在您完成报名期间，您的名额将为您保留 %s。','Your user account cannot publish events or locations in Events Manager. Run the import as an administrator.'=>'您的用户账户无法在 Events Manager 中发布活动或地址。请以管理员身份运行导入。','Your withdrawal policy text'=>'您的撤回政策文本','Zip or postal code'=>'邮政编码','Zoom Integration'=>'Zoom 集成','[%s] New User Registration'=>'[%s] 新用户注册','[%s] Your username and password'=>'[%s] 您的用户名和密码','[No %s Page]'=>'[无 %s 页面]','[Select a page]'=>'[选择页面]','`color` must be a valid hex colour (e.g. `#80b538`).'=>'`color` 必须是有效的十六进制颜色（例如 `#80b538`）。','`example_payload` is the minimal valid booking (required fields only). `example_payload_full` additionally shows every optional field at its correct location — the values are illustr